<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Taybo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Taybo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Taybo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tay</para>
  <para style="mt1">Taybo Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Taybo maxaafay Isra7eele asay Siina zumaappe boosoppe doommidi Xoossi isttas immanaas caaqqida mala arshey mokkiza baggara diza dhassaako matana gakkanaas hanida 40 layththa hano yootees. Ha maxaafaza sunththi maxaafaza giddon xaafettida ayfe yo7o bessees. Ha maxaafay heedzdzu ayfe yo7otan shaakettees; koyrozi Isra7eele asay Siina zumaa yeddi baanaappe kase hessaththoka issi yeletappe guye Yordaanoose shaafaappe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Mo7aaben Musey dereza qoodidayssa bessees (1:1—10:10). Nam7anththozi derey nam7uto qoodettidayssa garsan Isra7eele asay dugeha baggara diza Kanaane dhas gidida Qaadeese Barine gakkides; gido attiin isttas hidotay imettida dereyo gelanaas dandaybeettenna; hessa gishshas istti heen daro layth gam7idaappe guye Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey mokkiza baggara diza dere bidayssa bessees (10:11—21:20). Heedzdzanththozi bagga derezi heen daanaas qachchiin hankko attida derey Yordaanoose shaafappe gede pinnidi Kanaane baanaas giigettidayssa bessees (21:21—36:13). Taybo maxaafay yootizay daro wode metoy istta bolla gakkishin babbizaytanne hidota qanxxizayta, Xoossa bollanne istta kaaleththanaas Xoossi isttas doorida Muse bolla makkalliza dereta gishshassa; derezi azallanne makkalla gidikkoka Xoossi asaa lo7eththi al7ison oykkidayssi taarikezan qonccides; hessaththoka issi issito Muses dandayay dhaykkoka izas mino ammanoy diza gishshas izi Xoossassinne derezas ammaneteththan ooththidayssi qonccides.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">Siina zumaappe dendidi baanaas Isra7eele asaa giigeteth <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-9:23">1:1—9:23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Derezi dendanaappe sinththan qoodettides <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-4:49">1:1—4:49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Dumma dumma wogatanne maarata <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 5:1-8:26">5:1—8:26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Paaziga ba7aale nam7anththo bonchcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 9:1-23">9:1-23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Siina zumaappe Mo7aabe dere buus <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 10:1-21:35">10:1—21:35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mo7aabe deren polettida hanota <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-32:42">22:1—32:42</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gibxeppe Mo7aabe dere gakkanaas buus <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 33:1-49">33:1-49</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yordaanoose shaafaa pinnanaappe kase imettida azazota <char style="ior"><ref loc="NUM 33:50-36:13">33:50—36:13</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaas Koyro Qoodeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>Isra7eele asay Gibxeppe kezida nam7anththo layththan nam7anththa aginay doommida koyro gallas istti Siina bazzon dishin GODAY Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon Musera gayttidi, <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>«Attumasaa issaa issaa sunththan sunththan xaafada Isra7eele asaa qommon qommoninne zarkken zarkken qooda. <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>Neninne Aarooney isttas layththay nam7u tammunne izappe bollara diza oletti dandayana attumasata istta maaran maaran qoodite. <verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Dumma dumma zarkketappe istta kaaleththiza isttas aawatiza korapinneti inttenara gidetto. <verse eid="NUM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>Inttena maaddanayta sunththi hayssafe kaalli dizayta, Oroobeele zarkkefe Shaadure naa Elxuure, <verse eid="NUM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>Simoona zarkkefe Xurshadaye naa Salum7eele, <verse eid="NUM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>Yuhuda zarkkefe Aminadaabe naa Ne7asoone, <verse eid="NUM 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>Yisakoore zarkkefe Xu7aare naa Natina7eele, <verse eid="NUM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>Zaabiloone zarkkefe Heloone naa Elyaabe, <verse eid="NUM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>Yooseefe naytappe Efreeme qommoti Amihuude naa Elshama Minaase naytappe Pedaxuure naa Gamal7eele, <verse eid="NUM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>Biniyaame zarkkefe Gidi7oone naa Abidaane <verse eid="NUM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>Daane zarkkefe Amishadaye naa Ahi7ezeere, <verse eid="NUM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>Aaseere zarkkefe Okra naa Fagu7eele, <verse eid="NUM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>Gaade zarkkefe Da7u7eele naa Elyaasaafe, <verse eid="NUM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>Niftaaleme zarkkefe Enaane naa Ahire» gi yootides.<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Maabaraa garsafe zarkkefe zarkkefe Isra7eele asaa kaaleththanaas doorettida korapinneti haytantta.<verse eid="NUM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Museynne Aarooney hayta bantta sunththan xaafettidayta ekkida. <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>Nam7anththo aginay doommida koyro gallas maabaraza kumeth issi bolla shiishshidi zarkken zarkkeninne dabbon dabbon shiishshidaappe guye dereza qoodida; yelettiin layththay nam7u tammu kumidaytanne hessafekka bollara gidida attumasaa istta sunththan sunththan mazgabi qoodida. <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>Hessaththoka Musey GODAY azazida mala Siina bazzon dereza qoodides.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>Ola olettanaas dandayzayta layththay nam7u tammaanne hessafekka bollara dizayti bantta zarkkefe zarkkefe qoodettida; addeta qooday hayssafe kaallizayssa; <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>Oroobeele zarkkefe 46,500, <verse eid="NUM 1:21"/><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22-23"/>Simoona zarkkefe 59,300, <verse eid="NUM 1:22-23"/><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24-25"/>Gaade zarkkefe 45,650 <verse eid="NUM 1:24-25"/><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26-27"/>Yuhuda zarkkefe 74,600, <verse eid="NUM 1:26-27"/><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28-29"/>Yisakoore zarkkefe 54,400, <verse eid="NUM 1:28-29"/><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30-31"/>Zaabiloone zarkkefe 57,400, <verse eid="NUM 1:30-31"/><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32-33"/>Yooseefe naa Efreeme zarkkefe 40,500, <verse eid="NUM 1:32-33"/><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34-35"/>Yooseefe naa Minaase zarkkefe 32,200, <verse eid="NUM 1:34-35"/><verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36-37"/>Biniyaame zarkkefe 35,400, <verse eid="NUM 1:36-37"/><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38-39"/>Daane zarkkefe 62,700, <verse eid="NUM 1:38-39"/><verse number="40-41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40-41"/>Aaseere zarkkefe 41,500, <verse eid="NUM 1:40-41"/><verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42-43"/>Niftaaleme zarkkefe 53,400.<verse eid="NUM 1:42-43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Musey, Aarooneynne tammanne nam7u Isra7eele zarkketa korapinneti qoodida attuma asay haytantta; <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>olas baana dandayza addeti ubbay isttas layththay nam7u tammanne hessafekka bollara dizayti ba zarkken zarkken qoodettida. <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>Heyta qooday issi bolla 603,550 gidides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1-46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:1-51">Tay 26:1-51</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Gido attiin hankko zarkketara Lewe zarkketi qoodettibeettenna. <verse eid="NUM 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>Kase GODAY Muses, <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>«Ne Isra7eele attuma asaa qoodashe Lewe zarkketa isttara gaththa qoodoppa. <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>Lewe zarkketi gidikko Gaytoteththa Dunkaanenne iza giddon go7ettiza miishshaa bolla alaafeteth imma; istti Dunkaanezanne iza giddon go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa tookketto; dunkaana giddon ooththetto; iza yuushon dunkaani uttetto. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/>Intte kase dunkaani dizasoppe dendi biza wode Lewe zarkketi xalala Dunkaaneza shoddi laallidi istti shempiza ooraththason isttaka tokketto; isttafe attiin dunkaanaakko shiiqiza ay asikka hayqon qaxxayetto. <verse eid="NUM 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Hankko attida Isra7eele asay ba butten butteninne ba diza gutan gutan ba bandira bandira tokketto. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Gido attiin ay asikka dunkaanaakko shiiqidi tana hanqeththidi Isra7eele deraa dhaysisontta mala Lewe zarkketi he Dunkaaneza yuushon dunkaanidi naagetto» gides. <verse eid="NUM 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay GODAY Muse azazida mala ubbaaka ooththida.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Zarkketa Butten Butten Shaakereththo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>GODAY Musessinne Aaroones hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>«Isra7eele asay ba bagga bagga asaa erisiza malatanne bantta zarkke zarkke erisiza bandira kaallidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezappe guuththara haakkidi iza yuushon dunkaano.»<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>Arshey mokkiza baggara Yuhuda zarkketi uttetto; Yuhuda zarkke kaaleththanay Aminadaabe naa Ne7asoone. <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>Izi kaaleththiza asaa qooday 74,600.<verse eid="NUM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Yuhuda zarkketappe kaallidi Yisakoore qommoti istta matan dunkaani uttetto; Yisakoore zarkketa kaaleththanay Xu7aare naa Natina7eele. <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>He izappe garsara diza asaa qooday 54,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Yisakoore zarkketappe kaallidi Zaabiloone zarkketi dunkaani uttetto; Zaabiloone zarkketa kaaleththanay Heloone naa Elyaabe. <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>Izas diza asaa qooday 57,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Ba zarkken zarkken gididi Yuhuda zarkketi dunkaanida baggara uttida asaa qooday kumeth 186,400; asaappe sinth bizay hayssa ha buttezan diza asaa.<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>Dugeha baggara Oroobeele zarkketi ba baggata erisiza malata garsan dunkaani uttetto; Oroobeele zarkketa kaaleththizay Shaadure naa Elxuure. <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>Istta qooday 46,500. <verse eid="NUM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Oroobeele zarkketappe kaallidi Simoona zarkketi dunkaani uttetto; istta kaaleththanay Xurshadaye naa Salum7eele. <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>Istta qooday 59,300. <verse eid="NUM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Isttafe kaallidi Gaade zarkketi dunkaani uttetto; Gaade zarkketa kaaleththanay Era7u7eele naa Elyaasaafe. <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>Heytantta qooday 45,650. <verse eid="NUM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Istti ba zarkken zarkken gididi Oroobeeley dunkaani uttida baggara dunkaanida asaa qooday kumeth 151,450 gidides; Yuhuda buttezappe kaallidi nam7anththora bizay Oroobeele butteza.<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>Koyro nam7u buttetappenne wurseththa nam7u buttetappe giddon Lewe baggati Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza tookkidi betto; issi issi buttey ba qommoy shaaketti erettana mala dumma malata garsan bantta tara tara naagidi betto.<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>Arshey wulliza baggara Efreeme zarkketi ba baggata erisiza mala garsan dunkaani uttetto; Efreeme zarkke kaaleththanay Amihuude naa Elshama. <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>Isttas qooday 40,500. <verse eid="NUM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Efreeme zarkketappe kaallidi Minaase zarkketi dunkaanetto; Minaase zarkketa kaaleththanay Pedaxuure naa Gamal7eele. <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>Istta qooday 32,200. <verse eid="NUM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Isttafe kaallidi Biniyaame zarkketi dunkaani uttetto; Biniyaame zarkketa kaaleththanay Gidi7oone naa Abidaane. <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>He istta qooday 35,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Istti ba zarkken zarkken gididi Efreeme zarkketi dunkaani uttida baggara dunkaanida asaa qooday 108,100 gidides; Oroobeele butteza kaallidi heedzdzanththon Efreeme buttey bo.<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>Pudeha baggara Daane zarkketi ba baggata erisiza malata garsan dunkaani uttetto; Daane qommota kaaleththana halaqay Amishadaye naa Ahi7ezeere. <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>Istta qooday 62,700. <verse eid="NUM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Daane zarkketappe kaallidi Aaseere zarkketi dunkaani uttetto; Aaseere zarkketa kaaleththana halaqay Okra naa Fagu7eele. <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>Istta qooday 41,500. <verse eid="NUM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Isttafe kaallidi Niftaaleme zarkketi dunkaani uttetto; Niftaaleme zarkketa kaaleththana halaqay Enaane naa Ahire. <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>Heytantta qooday 53,400. <verse eid="NUM 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Istti ba zarkken zarkken gididi Daane zarkketi dunkaani uttida baggara dunkaanida asaa qooday kumeth 157,600 gidides. Hessaththoka Daane zarkketi wurseththan oydanththo maaran betto. <verse eid="NUM 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Isra7eele asay bason basoninne ba zarkken zarkken mazgabettidayta qooday issi bolla 603,550 gidides. <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Lewe zarkketi gidikko GODAY kase Muse azazida mala hankko Isra7eele asaara qoodettibeettenna.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Hessa malan Isra7eele asay GODAY kase Muse azazida mala ooththida; istta zarkketappe issoy issoy ba bandira bandira kaalli kaalli dunkaani uttides; issoy issoy ba soo asaara issife hemettees.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Aaroone Attuma Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>GODAY Muse Siina zuma bolla haasayssiza wode Aaroone yeletaynne Muse yeletay hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; <verse eid="NUM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Aaroones oyddu attuma nayti deettes; heytikka bayrazi Nadaabe gidishin hankkoyti Abihu, El7ezeerenne Itamaare.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:60">Tay 26:60</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Heyti qeeseteththan ooththana mala tiyettidanne summida. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/>Gido attiin istta garsafe Nadaabeynne Abihuy Siina bazzon GODAA sinththan bessontta tama ehidi eeththida gishshas GODAA hanqon boshetti hayqqida; Isttas nay baynda gishshas El7ezeereynne Itamaarey xalla istta aawa Aarooney shemppora paxa diza wode ubbaan qeeseteththan ooththida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lewe 10:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 26:61">Tay 26:61</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leweta Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>«Neni Lewe zarkketa shiishshada istti qeese Aaroone ooson maaddana mala woththa. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>Istti Aaroonenne kumeththa maabaraa Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon ooththi maadon ba oosoza ooththi poletto. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon diza ooso miishshatas istta alaafe gidetto; Dunkaaneza giddon Isra7eele asaas oosettiza ooso ooththi poletto. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>Isra7eele asaa ubbaafe istti shaakettidi Aaroonenne iza nayta ooson maaddana mala Lewe zarkketa woththa. <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>Qeeseteththa oosoza istti polana mala Aaroonenne iza nayta ne sunththa; isttafe attiin hara asi hayssa ha oosoza ooththanaas Gaytoteththa dunkaanezakko shiiqizaa gidikko izaadey hayqon qaxxayetto.»<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12-13"/>«Hekko Lewe qommoti taas haggazizayta; tani Gibxe dere asaa bayra wursa wodhida wode Isra7eele asaappe issaafe issaafe yelettida bayranne istta meheta bayrata kumeth taas dummasadis; gido attiin ha7i qasse bayra gidi yelettida attuma nayta sohon Lewe zarkketa tani taas dooradis; istti taas ooththizayta gidana; tani GODAA.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kessa 13:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 3:12-13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leweta Qoodeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>GODAY Muses Siina zumaa bolla hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>«Lewe zareta istta istta zarkken zarkkeninne istta qommon qommon qooda; yelettiin izas issi agina kumidayssanne hessafe bollara diza attuma naa wursaka qooda.» <verse eid="NUM 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Museykka GODAY iza azazida mala qoodides. <verse eid="NUM 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Lewes heedzdzu attuma nayti deettes; heytikka Gershoone, Qa7aatenne Meraare geetetteettes. <verse eid="NUM 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Gershoone zarkketi Libinanne Shim7e geetetteettes. <verse eid="NUM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Qa7aate zarkketi Amiraame Yixihaare, Kebroonenne Uzi7eele geetetteettes <verse eid="NUM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Meraare zarkketi Mahilenne Mushe geetetteettes; heytantti ba sunththan sunththan ba keeththa asaas aawatizayta.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Libinanne Shim7e keeththa asay Gershoone zarkken qoodettida. <verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>Yelettiin issi agina gidida naappe doommidi mazgabettida attumasaa qooday 7,500. <verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Gershoone baggati Dunkaanezappe guye baggara arshey wulliza baggara dunkaanida. <verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>Gershoone baggata kaaleththizay La7eele naa Elyaasaafe. <verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen Gershoone zarkketa alaafeteththi, Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza kamatanne penge bolla qaaphettiza magalashata, <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>Gibbeza giddo magalashata, Dunkaanezanne yarsho yarshizasoza yuuyi aadhdhida gibbeza pengaa magalasha toletanne hessaththoka heytanttas gidiza miishshata ubbata naago.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Amiraame, Yixihaare, Kebroonenne Uzi7eele soo asay Qa7aate zarkken qoodettida. <verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>Yelettiin issi aginanne hessafe bollara gidida attumasaa qooday 8,600; heytantti Gaytoteththa dunkaaneza naageettes. <verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Qa7aate zarkketi Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezappe guyera dugeha baggara dunkaanida. <verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>Qa7aate qommota kaaleththiza korapinney Uzi7eele naa Elxafaane. <verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Istta alaafeteththi Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa bolla, maadda iza bolla woththiza xaraphpheeza bolla, xomppe iza bolla woththizayssa bolla, yarsho iza bolla yarshizayssa bolla, qeeseti dumma qol7azan go7ettiza miishshata bolla, gede Dunkaanezas ubbaafe dummatida giddo qol7a gelizaso baggara diza magalashaa gidishin kumeth hayta ha miishshata bolla isttas naagana alaafeteththi dees.<verse eid="NUM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Lewe zarkke ubbaa halaqay qeese Aaroone naa El7ezeere; izi dummatida qol7an ooththizayta ubbaa bolla alaafe.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Mahile soo asaynne Mushe soo asay Meraare zarkkera issino gidida; heyti Meraare zarkken qoodettida. <verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>Yelettiin issi agina gidida guuththa naappe doommidi qoodettida attumasaa qooday usupun xeetanne nam7u xeeta. <verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Meraare zarkketa kaaleththizay Xuri7eele naa Abi7eele; istti Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezappe pudeha baggara dunkaani uttida. <verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Istta alaafeteththi Dunkaaneza toleta, kolatata, tuussatanne tuussata isttan essiza tohota, hessaththoka hara oosos go7ettiza miishshata bollanne heytanttas bessiza oosota ooththana alaafeteththi dees. <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>Hessaththoka gibbeza yuushon diza tuussata, Dunkaaneza toleta, dhishketanne tole wodorota bolla alaafeteththi dees.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezappe arshey mokkiza baggara dunkaani uttanayti Muse, Aaroonenne iza nayta; Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon Isra7eele asaa gishshas oosettiza ay ooso gidikkoka he oosoza woga polisiza alaafey istta gidetto; haray oonikka gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaane keeththazakko shiiqikko hayqon qaxxayetto. <verse eid="NUM 3:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>GODAY istta azazida mala Museynne Aarooney yelettiin issi agina gidida naappe doommidi asay ba keeththan keeththan mazgabida Lewe qommotappe attuma nayti kumeth 22,000 gidida.<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewe Zarkketa Dooreteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>GODAY Muses, «Isra7eelen bayra gidi yelettida attuma naytas layththay issi aginanne hessafe bollara gididayta qoodada istta sunththaa xaafa. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Isra7eele asaa bayra nayta ubbaa saama Lewe nayta, hessaththoka Isra7eele asaa mehe bayra ubbaa saama Lewe qommota mehe ekka; Tani GODAA» gides. <verse eid="NUM 3:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Museykka bana GODAY azazida mala Isra7eele asaa garsan bayra gidi yelettidayta ubbaa qoodides. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Istti yelettiin issi aginanne hessafe bollara gidida bayra attuma nayta ubbaa istta sunththan sunththan qoodiin istta qooday 22,273 gidides.<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>«Hessa gishshas bayra giidi yelettida Isra7eele asaa attuma nayta sohon Leweta ne taas shaakka; hessaththoka Isra7eele asaa mehe bayra sohon Leweta mehe taas dummasa; tani GODAA. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Isra7eele asay yelida bayra nayta qooday Lewe qommotappe 273 gidi dariza gishshas heyta tirpa attuma nayta miishshan wozza. <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>Issaa issaa wozzanaas Gaytoteththa Dunkaane meezaaneza mala ichchashu Saqile bira ekka; <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>He attida wozzo miishshaa Aaroonessinne iza naytas imma.»<verse eid="NUM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Museykka Lewe qommotan wozzettidaytappe bollara tirpida 273 asata gishshas shiiqida wozzo miishshaa ekkides. <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>Isra7eele asaa bayratappe Gaytoteththa Dunkaane meezaaneza mala miishshaa 1,365 saqile bira ekkides. <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>GODAY azazida mala Musey wozzo miishshaa Aaroonessinne iza naytas immides.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Qa7aate Zarkketa Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>GODAY Musessinne Aaroones hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>«Lewe nayta giddofe Qa7aate zareta istta soo asaan asaan istta mata dabbon dabbon qooda. <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>Gaytoteththa dunkaanezan ooththanaas dandayzayta, istta layththi heedzdzu tammaafe biidi ichchashu tammu gakkanaas diza attumasata ubbaa mazgaba. <verse eid="NUM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>Istti ooththana oosoy Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon diza ubbaafe dumma geeshsha miishshata naago gidana. <verse eid="NUM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>Asay ba dizasoppe dendi bishin Aarooneynne iza nayti dunkaanezan gelidi Caaqo Qaala Taabotaza sinththan diza magalashaa duge woththidi Caaqo Qaala Taabotaza izan xaaxetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>Iza kammanaas qaacettida galbaa magalashaza bollara woththidi hessa bolla mulera salo mala kareththa may7o iza bolla miccidi mayzetto; histtidi tooho miththata qalabate lukozan gelththetto.<verse eid="NUM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>«GODAAS shiiqiza dumma ukeththaa iza bolla woththiza gabateza salo misatiza kareththa carqqan kammetto; Gabateza bolla shel7eta, Cilfata, xuu7atanne woyne ushshu duuqqiza miishshatanne uketh ubba wode pacey baynda iza bolla woththetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>Hessa ubbaa zo7o carqqan kammidi bollara qaacettida galba mayzetto; isttan tookkiza tooho miththata qalabate lukozan gelththetto.<verse eid="NUM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>«Salo misatiza kareththa carqqaza ekkidi xomppe iza bolla woththizayssanne xomppeta, qaphetanne bidinth woththiza kon7ata, hessaththoka zayte woththiza miishshata ubbaa issi bolla kammetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>Xomppezanne xomppezas koshshiza miishshata ubbaaka iza kammiza galban xaaxidi izara tookkiza halaa bolla woththetto.<verse eid="NUM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>«Kaaleththidi worqqafe oosettida yarsho yarshizayssa bolla salo misatiza carqqan kammidi qaacettida galbaa bollara mayzidi tooho miththata izan gelththetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa ekkidi salo mala kareththa carqqan kammetto; qaacettida lee7e galba iza bollara kammidi tooho miththaa bolla woththetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>Bidinththaza yarsho yarshizasoza bollafe pittidi yarsho yarshizasoza ochcha teera misatiza carqqan kammetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>Yarsho yarshizasozan ooththanaas go7ettiza miishshata heytikka hulaleta, menxota, tama kaashiza miishshatanne guuqa saaneta iza bolla woththetto; qaacettida lee7e galba iza bolla kammidi tooho miththata izan gelththetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>Istti ba diza heeraappe dendi bishin Aarooneynne iza nayti geeshsha miishshatanne he miishshati isttan go7ettiza miishshata ubbaaka kammidaappe guye Qa7aate nayti yiidi tooketto; gido attiin istti hayqqontta mala he geeshsha miishshata kushen bochchanaas bessenna; hessa gishshas Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezi dendiza wode hessi wurikka Qa7aate nayta alaafeteththa.<verse eid="NUM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>«Qeeseza Aaroone naa El7ezeerey xomppeza zayte lo7o sawo sawiza exaane, ubba wode shiiqiza kaththa yarshozaninne tiyettiza zayteza bolla izas alaafeteththi de7o; hessaththoka Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezanne iza giddonkka diza geeshsha miishshata ubbaa naago.»<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>GODAY Musenne Aaroone hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>«Qa7aate nayti Lewe qommota giddofe dhayana mala ooththofte. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Gede ubbaafe dumma geeshsha miishshatakko shiiqidi istti hayqqontta mala istta Aarooneynne iza nayti Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen gelidi asaas issaas issaas oosonne izaade tooho shaakki immetto. <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>Gido attiin istti hayqqontta mala Qa7aate nayti Dunkaaneza giddo gelidi beyanaas guuththa wodeska xeellopetto.»<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gershoone Zarkketa Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>«Lewe zarkketa garsafe Gershoone nayta istta dabbon dabboninne istta yeletan yeletan qooda. <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan ooththanaas dandayzayta heedzdzu tammu layththafe biidi ichchashu tammu layth gakkanaas diza attumasata ubbaa qooda.<verse eid="NUM 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>«Dumma dumma miishshata tookkana alaafeteththi isttas dees. <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza soo baggaranne kare baggara kammiza bollarakka iza bolla kammiza qaacettida lee7e galbaanne geloso pengezakka tookketto. <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>Hessaththoka Dunkaanezanne yarsho yarshosoho gibbeza yuuyi aadhdhida magalashata, tole wodorota, gibbe gelizaso penge magalashatanne heytantta ooththanaas giigettida miishshatakka istti tookketto; heyta he miishshatas gidiza ay oosokka istti poletto. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Gershoone nayti ooththiza ooso gidiin woykko tooho gidiin Aarooneynne iza nayti istta azazida mala ooththetto; istti tookkanaas bessiza miishshaa kumeth ne isttas gisha imma. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon Gershoone nayta oosoy hessa; istta ooso qeese Aaroone naa Itamaarey xeelli oosiso.<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meraare Zarkketa Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>«Lewe zarkkefe gidida Meraare nayta istta zarkken zarkkeninne istta yeletan yeletan qooda. <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon ooththanaas dandayzayta isttas layththay 30 layththafe biidi 50 layth gakkanaas diza attumasata ubbaa qooda. <verse eid="NUM 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>Istti tookkanaas bessizay Dunkaaneza toletanne toleta giddora gelizayta, tuussata; Dunkaanezi izan tolettiza miishshata. <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>Hessaththoka Dunkaaneza yuushon diza demban eqqiza tuussata tohota; toleta wodorotanne heyta ubbatas koshshiza miishshata; issi issi asi tookkanaas bessiza miishshay iza sunththan sunththan izas utto. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Qeese Aaroone naa Itamaarey oosoza naagetti oosisanaas Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon Meraare nayta soo asaa oosoy hayssa.»<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewe Zarkketa Qooda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Musey, Aarooneynne dereza halaqati Qa7aate zereththata istta zarkken zarkkeninne istta dabbon dabbon qoodida. <verse eid="NUM 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon ooththanaas ooson gelidayta kumeth 30 layththafe biidi 50 layth gididayta qoodida. <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>Qoodettida asay 2,750 gidides. <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>GODAY kase Muse azazida mala Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan ooththidayti Museynne Aarooney qoodida Qa7aate soo asay haytantta.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Ba zarkken zarkkeninne ba dabbon dabbon qoodettida Gershoone nayti, <verse eid="NUM 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan ooththana gelanaas dandayzaytas layththay heedzdzu tammaafe biidi ichchashu tammu layth gakkanaas dizayti wurikka, <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>nam7u shiyanne usuppun xeetanne heedzdzu tamma. <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan ooththidaytinne Museynne Aarooney qoodida Gershoone nayti haytantta.<verse eid="NUM 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Ba zarkken zarkkeninne ba dabbon dabbon qoodettida Meraare nayti, <verse eid="NUM 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan ooththana gelanaas dandayzaytas layththay heedzdzu tammaafe biidi ichchashu tammu layth gakkanaas dizayti wurikka, <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>heedzdzu shiyanne nam7u xeeta. <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan haggaziza Museynne Aarooney qoodida Meraare nayti haytantta. <verse eid="NUM 4:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Musey, Aarooneynne Isra7eele halaqati istta qommon qommoninne istta zarkken zarkken qoodida Lewe nayti, <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>heedzdzu tammu layththafe doommidi 50 layth gakkanaas dizayti Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon oosoza ooththanaas ooththiza miishshata tookkanaas gelidayti, <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>mulera istta qooday 8,580. <verse eid="NUM 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>Hessa malan issi issi asi GODAY Muse azazida mala qoodettides; hessaththoka GODAY Muses immida azazo mala issi issi asi tookkanaas alaafeteth ekkides.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeyontta Asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>«Inchchirachcha hargey iza bolla dizaade woykko iza bollaafe haaththa malay goggizaade woykko aha bochchidi tunidaade ubbaa Isra7eele asay ba diza gutappe kare kessana mala azaza. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>Tani isttara diza istta guta istti tunisontta mala heyta geeyontta asata ubbaa adde gidiin macca gidiin intte giddofe kessi gooddite.» <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>GODAY Muse azazida mala Isra7eele asay ba gutappe istta kessi gooddides.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qoho Gishshas Qanxxo Imo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>GODAY Muses hizgides,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 6:1-7">Lewe 6:1-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, maccafe gidiin attumasappe ay asikka GODAAS ammanettonttaade gidi beettidi ay asa bollaka qoho gaththiko hessaadey qohanchcha. <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>Izi ba nagara paaxo; ba qohoza gishshas qanxxettiza miishshaa bolla xeetappe nam7u tammu kushe gujjidi qohettidaades eho. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Gido attiin he qohettidaadey hayqqidaa gidikkonne edaa ekkanaas izas mata dabboy bayndaa gidikko he eday GODAASSA; he edatiza eday qohidaade nagara wursana shiiqiza yarshos immiza dharshozara issife qeesezas imetto. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>Hessa malan Isra7eele asay GODAAS immiza dumma imotay wurikka he imotaa ekkiza qeesezas gido. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Issi issi asi GODAAS immiza dumma imotay he imotaa immidaadessa; gido attiin izi qeesezas immizaa gidikko he miishshay qeesezassa.»<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanettontta Machcheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>«Isra7eele asaappe issaade machcha ba azinaas ammanettontta aggada kare kare giikko, <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>hara addera zin7iko, qasseka iza ooththida tuna oosoy qonccontta azinappe geemmidaa gidikko, izi bolla markkattiza asi beettontta aggiin izi tunateththay qonccontta aggiko, <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>iza tunida gishshas izi azinay izo sidhanaas dandayees; woykko iza tunontta dishin izi qanaaten kumida gishshas ba machcho sidhana dandayees. <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>Hessaadey ba machchiyo qeesekko ekki eho; he maccassay gishshas koyettiza issi kilo bangga dhiille yarshos ekki yo; hayssi qanaates shiiqiza kaththa yarshoy qoho qofsizaaz gidiza gishshas zayte iza bolla gussofo; exaanekka iza bolla woththofo.<verse eid="NUM 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>«Qeesezi maccassayo efidi GODAA sinththan esso. <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>Geeshsha haath xaaron duuqqi ekko; Gaytoteththa Dunkaane wuygeppe guuththa biitta ekkidi he haaththaan gujjo. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Qeesezi maccassayo GODAA sinththan esso; izi goosse birsho; qanaates shiiqiza kaththa yarshoza izi kushen woththo; qasse he qeesezi qanggeth ehiza camo haath xaarora ba kushen oykko. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>Qeesezi izo hizgi caaqeththo; neni ne azinara dishin hara addey nenara aqontta gidikkonne neni nena tunisontta gidikko qanggeth ehiza hayssi camo haaththay nees gometoppo. <verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Gido attiin neni ne azinappe hara addera zin7ada tunidaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>‹GODAY nees yela ulo melisonne ne ulo puuriso! Ne dereza garsan nena caaqossinne qanggeththas kesso. <verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>Hayssi haaththazi gede ne bolla giddo gelidi ne uloza puuriso! Nees yela uloza gundiso!› Maccassayakka, ‹Amiin! GODAY ta bolla hessaththo ooththo› ga zaaru.<verse eid="NUM 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>«Hessafe guye qeesezi hessa he qanggeththa qaala xaaththa maxaafan xaafo; he xaafoyssaka camo haaththazi diza xaarozan yeggi meecco. <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>Izi maccassayo iita sako oyththiza camo haaththaa izo ushshanaappe sinththan, <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>qeesezi maccassayfe yarsho dhiilleza ekkidi GODAAS yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza dumma yarsho gidana mala yarsho yarshizasoza bolla shiishsho. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>Hessafe guye kaththa yarsho issi zolla dhiille ekkidi qofso yarsho gidana mala yarsho yarshizasoza bolla xuuggo; wurseththan he maccassayo he haaththaa ushsho. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Maccassaya bana tunisada ba azinaas diza ammaneteththaa pacinchchidaa gidikko qanggeth ehiza haaththaa iza uyiza wode izi bolla giddon wolqqama sako ehana; hessika izi uloy puurana; izis yela uloy gundana; izi sunththi izi dereza giddon qanggettidaaz gidi attana. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Gido attiin iza aykko moorokka ooththonttaa gidikko izi bolla aykko qohoykka gakkenna; iza naytakka yelana.<verse eid="NUM 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>«Issaadey ba machcho laymateththan sidhiza wode ooththana wogay hayssafe kaallizayssa; iza kare kare gaada hara addera zin7ada tunidaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>woykko issi asi ba machcho coo mela sidhizaa gidikko iza GODAA sinththan eqqana mala ooththo. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Izi azinazikka qohoppe geesh gidana; maccassaya laymata beettidaa gidikko qasse iza ba qohoza gaason ba bolla gakkiza pirda ekkana.»<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Naaziraaweteththa Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>«Isra7eele asaas, ‹Macca gidiin woykko adde gidiin ay asikka bana GODAAS dummasanaas adina adinettiko, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>hessaadey woyne ushshu woykko hara maththosiza ushshu uyoppo; woyneppe woykko harappe oosettida caala woykko maththosiza ushshu izi uyoppo; woyne miththa ayfeppe tiya gidiin woykko mela gidiin mooppo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:15">Luqa 1:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>Izi bana dummasidi diza woden woyne miththa hagga bolla diza ayfe gidiin woykko poqo mooppo.<verse eid="NUM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>« ‹Izi naaziraaweteththas adinettida wodey wurana gakkanaas izaade hu7e binana magallay bochchofo; izi bana GODAAS dummasida wodey polettana gakkanaas izi dummatidaade gididi ba hu7e binana dichcho.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Magalla guussi kase wode asay hu7e binana meediza qeeri biillama.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>Izi naaziraawe gidi diza wode ubbaan hayqqida ahaakko shiiqoppo. <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>Izi ba Godaas bana dummasida malatay iza hu7e bolla diza gishshas izas aaway woykko aaya woykko izas ishay woykko michcha hayqqiko istta aha bochchidi izi bana tunisoppo. <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>Izi bana Naaziraawe ooththida wode ubbaan izi GODAAS dummatida asa.<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>« ‹Izi qoppontta dishin issaadey iza achchan hayqqidi kase dummati diza iza hu7e binana tunisikko izi laappunththa gallas ba hu7e binana meedetti buluso. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Osppunththa gallas nam7u haraphpheta woykko haraphphe ciyeta Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza pengen diza qeesezakko eho. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Qeesezikka issi haraphpheza nagara yarshos nam7anththoza qasse xuugettiza yarshos shiishsho; gaasoykka izi aha mata shiiqidi tunida gishshas qeesezi iza nagaraa wursana; he gallassika naaziraawey ba hu7e iskeza nam7anththo GODAAS dummaso. <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>Izi naaziraaweteththan ooththanaas bana GODAAS nam7anththo dummaso; GODAAS dummatida he iza iskezi tunida gishshas hessafe kase izi naaziraaweteththan gam7ida wodey izas qoodan gelenna; izi ba qohoza gishshas issi layththa dharsho laaqqa eho.<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>« ‹Issi naaziraawey ba naaziraaweteththa adina ubba wode izi polana wogay hayssafe kaalli dizayssa; izi gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen geliza pengezakko biidi, <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>heen ba yarsho GODAAS shiishsho; hessika xuugettiza yarshos issi layth kumida dharsho laaqqa, nagara yarshos issi layth kumida uzzi dors, hessaththoka issifeteththa yarshos wosoy baynda dharsho shiishsho. <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>Qasse kaththa yarshonne ushsha yarsho isttara issife yarshanaas eho; he leematezan kaththa yarshoy irshoy izan gelonttayssa gido; qasse liiqo dhiille zayten munuqi uukkida orde ukeththinne zayten tiyettida lee7e uketh eho.<verse eid="NUM 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>« ‹Qeesezikka hessa ubbaa nagara yarshonne xuugettiza yarsho ooththidi GODAA sinth shiishsho. <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>Dharshozanne leematera irshoy izan gelontta ukeththata issifeteththa yarsho ooththidi GODAAS shiishsho; qasse hessara issife gaththidi kaththa yarshonne ushsha yarsho yarsho.<verse eid="NUM 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>« ‹Hessafe guye Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan geliza penge bolla he naaziraawezi GODAAS adinettida ba hu7e binana meedettidi issifeteththa yarshoy xuugettiza taman yeggo.<verse eid="NUM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>« ‹Bana Godaas dummasida naaziraawey ba hu7e binana meedettidaappe guye qeesezi doysettida dharshoza missa asho, irshoy gelontta uukettida orde ukeththinne lee7e uketh leemateppe ekkidi he naaziraaweza kushen woththo. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Hessafe guye qeesezi ubbaa ekkidi GODAA sinththan yaanne haa qaaseththiza yarsho histti shiishsho; heytikka GODAAS dummatida yarsho; he qaaseththida angasoynne missazi qeesezas gido; hessafe guye naaziraawezi woyne ushshu uyanaas dandayees.<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>« ‹Hessa gishshas GODAAS bana dummasanaas adinida naaziraawes wodhdhida wogay bana Godaas yarshanaas koshshiza yarshotappe bollara aaththi geppiko izi qaala gelida mala ba adinaa polanaas bessees ga yoota› gees.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:23-24">Hawa 21:23-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseti Wurseththan Anjjana Anjjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>GODAY Muses hizgides; <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>«Aarooneynne iza nayti Isra7eele deraa anjjishe hizgi anjjetto,<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>‹GODAY nena anjjo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">izi nena naago;<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>GODAY ba ayfeso poo7o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">nees qoncciso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">izi nees qadhetto.<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>GODAY nena ba maaroteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">ayfen xeello;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">ba saroteththka izi nees immo›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">gaada yoota.»<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>Qasseka GODAY, «Istti Isra7eele asaa ta sunththan anjjiza wode tani istta anjjana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Halaqati Immida Imota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Musey Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza toli giigida wode Dunkaanezanne izan go7ettiza miishshata ubbaa, yarsho yarshizasozanne izan go7ettiza miishshata tiydi dummasides. <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizayti, deraa qoodiza wode istta bolla alaafeteththi diza korapinneti wuri ba yarsho yarsho GODAAS shiishshida. <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>Istti shiishshida yarshoti nam7u nam7u halaqata sunththan issi para-gaare, hessaththoka issi issi halaqa sunththan issi issi boora; he istti shiishshida yarshoti issi bolla usuppun para-gaaretanne tamman nam7u boorata; heyta he yarshotakka Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza sinththan shiishshida. <verse eid="NUM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>«Hayti miishshati Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan dumma dumma oosos isttan go7ettana mala hayta yarsho miishshata isttafe ekkada, dumma dumma oosos isttas koshshiza mala shaakkada Lewetas imma.»<verse eid="NUM 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Hessa gishshas Musey para-gaaretanne boorata ekkidi Lewetas immides. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>Gershoone zarkketas oosos koshshiza nam7u para-gaaretanne oyddu boorata immides. <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>Qasseka Meraare zarkketas oyddu para-gaaretanne osppun boorata immides; heytantta oosoy polettanay Aaroone naa Itamaare alaafeteththanna. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Isttas diza alaafeteththi geeshsha miishshata ba hashen tookkiza gishshas Musey Qa7aate zarkketas para-gaareta gidiin woykko booratakka immibeenna.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Yarsho yarshizasoza Musey tiydi geeshshida gallas halaqati yarsho yarshizasoza anjjisanaas bantta imota ehidi yarsho yarshizasoza sinththan shiishshida. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>GODAY Muses, «Tammanne nam7u gallassatan tammanne nam7u halaqati pacey baynda issoy issoy issi issi gallas anjjiso ba7aales gidiza yarsho hu7en hu7en shiishshana mala yoota» gides.<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Koyro gallas Yuhuda qommota garsafe Aminadaabe naa Ne7asooney shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta; erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">130 saqiley 1.5 kilo giraame gidees.</char></note> birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">70 saqiley 0.8 kilo giraame gidees.</char></note> issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kath yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida 10 saqile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">10 saqiley 110 giraame gidees.</char></note> worqqafe oosettida cilfa. <verse eid="NUM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Aminadaabe naa Ne7asooney shiishshida yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Nam7anththo gallas Yisakoore zarkketa garsafe Xu7aare naa Natina7eeley shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin xeetanne heedzdzu tammu saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne laappun tammu saqile guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumi uttides. <verse eid="NUM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfa. <verse eid="NUM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo; issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Xu7aare naa Natina7eeley shiishshida yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Heedzdzanththo gallas Zaabiloone zarkketa garsafe Heloone naa Elyaabey shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin xeetanne heedzdzu tammu saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne laappun tammu saqile guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfa. <verse eid="NUM 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo; issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>Issifeteththa yarshos 5 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Heloone naa Elyaabey shiishshida yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Oydanththo gallas Oroobeele qommota garsafe Shaadure naa Elxuurey shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7anka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqay kumi uttides. <verse eid="NUM 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Shaadure naa Elxuurey shiishshida yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Ichchashanththo gallas Simoona qommota garsafe Xurshadaye naa Salum7eeley shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida ichchashu dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Xurshadaye naa Salum7eeley shiishshida yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Usuppunththo gallas Gaade zarkketa garsafe Da7u7eele naa Elyaasaafey shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanawu liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>Issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Da7u7eele naa Elyaasaafey shiishshida yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Laappunththo gallas Efreeme zarkketa garsafe Amihuude naa Elshamay shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Amihuude naa Elshama yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Osppunththa gallas Minaase zarkketa garsafe Pedaxuure naa Gamal7eeley shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>Nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Pedaxuure naa Gamal7eele yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Uddufunththo gallas Biniyaame zarkketa garsafe Gidi7oone naa Abidaaney shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Gidi7oone naa Abidaane yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Tammanththo gallas Daane qommota garsafe Amishadaye naa Ahi7ezeerey shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>Xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Amishadaye naa Ahi7ezeere yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Tammanne issinththa gallas Aaseere qommota garsafe Okra naa Fagu7eeley shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Okra naa Fagu7eele yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Tammanne nam7anththa gallas Niftaaleme zarkketa garsafe Enaane naa Ahirey shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 7:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>Izi shiishshida yarshotikka hayssafe kaallizayta, erettida meezaanen woththiin 130 saqile birappe oosettida issi picca saanenne 70 saqile issi guuqa saane, nam7ayka kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqan kumida. <verse eid="NUM 7:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>Izan exaaney kumi uttida issi tammu saqile worqqafe oosettida cilfata, <verse eid="NUM 7:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>xuugettiza yarshos issi mirgo, issi dharsho, issi layththa dharsho laaqqa, <verse eid="NUM 7:81"/><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>nagara yarshos issi deysha orge, <verse eid="NUM 7:82"/><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>issifeteththa yarshos 2 boorata, 5 dharshota, 5 deysha orgetanne layth kumida 5 dharsho laaqqata; heyti wuri Enaane naa Ahire yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Yarsho yarshizasoza tiydi geeshshida gallas halaqati yarshosoza anjjiso gaason shiishshida imotay haytantta; birappe oosettida 12 picca saaneta, birappe oosettida 12 guuqa saanetanne worqqafe oosettida isttan exaane woththiza 12 kereta. <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>Birappe oosettida issi issi kerey 130 saqile gidi deexxees; birappe oosettida issi issi quule mala saaney 7 saqile gidi deexxees; birappe oosettida keretinne quule mala saaneti Xoossa Keeththa meezaanen woththiza wode ubbay issi bolla 2,400 saqile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:85 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2,400 Saqiley 28 kilo giraame gidees.</char></note> gidida. <verse eid="NUM 7:85"/><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>Worqqafe oosettida exaaney istta kumi uttida tammanne nam7u shaatetti GODAA Keeththa meezaanen woththiza wode issoy issoy 10 saqile gidishin ubbay issi bolla 120 saqile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:86 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">120 Saqiley 1.4 kilo giraame gidees.</char></note> gidides. <verse eid="NUM 7:86"/><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>Kaththa yarshora issife xuugettiza yarshos shiiqida mehe qooday 12 boorata, 12 dharshotanne layth kumida 12 dharsho laaqqata; qasse istti nagara yarshos shiishshiday 12 deysha orgeta. <verse eid="NUM 7:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>Issifeteththa yarshos shiiqida mehe qooday 24 boora, 60 dharsho, 60 deysha orgenne layth kumida 60 dharsho laaqqa; yarsho yarshizasozi tiyetti geeyidaappe guye anjjiso ba7aales imettida imotati haytantta. <verse eid="NUM 7:88"/><verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Musey GODAARA haasayanaas gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan geliin atoteth demmanaas shiiqizason Taabotaa kama bolla diza nam7u Kirubeta giddora GODAY izas haasayza qaala siyidi izikka izara haasayettides.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Xomppeta Wososo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>« ‹Neni Aaroones laappun xomppeta istta bolla woththiza wode xomppeti xomppe istta bolla woththiza ballatas sinththa baggara dizaso poo7isana› gaada yoota.»<verse eid="NUM 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Aarooneykka GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththides; xomppeta istta bolla woththiza ballatappe sinththa baggara dizasoza poo7isana mala giigsi woththides. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Xomppeta istta bolla woththiza ballati garsa tohosoppe doommidi ciishshe misatiza ballata xeera gakkanaas qoxettida worqqafe oosettida; heytikka GODAY Muse bessida mala xomppe istta bolla woththiza ballata leemison oosettida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Kessa 25:31-40</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 37:17-24">37:17-24</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lewe Zarkketi Geeyidi Dummatiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>«Hankko attida Isra7eele deraa garsafe Lewe qommota dumma shaakkada geeshsha. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>Geesho wogas giigettida haaththan istta araca; istti bantta bolla diza iske ubbaa meedettanaassinne ba may7oka meeccidi bana geeshshana mala ooththa. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>Hessafe kaallidi issi mirgonne kaththa yarshos gidiza liiqo dhiillefe zayten munuqettida munuqa ekki betto; nekka nagara yarshos shiiqiza issi mirgo ekka ba. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>Hessafe guye ne Isra7eele asaa shiishshada Leweti Gaytoteththa Dunkaanaas sinththa baggara GODAA sinththan essa. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>Isra7eele asaykka Leweta hu7e bolla ba kushe woththo. <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>Aarooney Leweta GODAA ooso ooththanaas giigettidayta gidana mala Isra7eele asaa garsafe yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza yarsho ooththidi istta GODAA sinth shiishsho.<verse eid="NUM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>«Hessafe guye Leweti ba kusheta he nam7u mirgota hu7e bolla woththetto; issaa nagara wurso yarshos, issaa xuugettiza yarshos ooththada istta maarisanaas GODAA sinththan yarsha. <verse eid="NUM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>Leweta yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza yarsho histtada GODAA sinth shiishsha; Aaroonenne iza naytakka istta bolla shuuma. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Hessa malan Leweti tayta gidana mala hankko attida Isra7eele asaa giddofe ne taas istta shaakka.<verse eid="NUM 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>«Neni Leweta shaakka geeshshidaappenne yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza yarsho histtidaappe guye istti Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon ooththana bessiza oosoza polanaas yetto. <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Tani istta koyro bayra yelettiza Isra7eele asaa attuma nayta ubbaa gishshas taas dooradis; Isra7eele asaa giddofe istti taas mulera buzo gidana. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Gibxe biittan bayra yelettida asaappe mehe gakkanaas dizayta tani wodhida wode Isra7eele asaa issaa issaa keeththan adde gididi bayra yelettida asaappe mehe gakkanaas dizayta ubbaa taas dummasa shaakkadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kessa 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Ha7i qasse Isra7eele asaa bayra attuma nayta gishshas Lewe zarkketa taas shaakkadis. <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>Istti Isra7eele asaa gishshas gididi Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon taas ooththana malanne Isra7eele asay gede geeshshasozakko shiiqidi boshan boshettontta mala istta naagana mala Leweta Isra7eele asaa garsafe taas imota mala ekkada Aaroonessinne iza naytas immadis.»<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Hessa gishshas GODAY Muse azazida mala Musey, Aarooneynne Isra7eele asay ubbay Leweta dummasi shaakkida. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/>Leweti meecetti geeyida; ba may7oka meeccida; Aarooney istta yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza yarsho histti GODAA sinth shiishshides; geesho wogaakka istta gishshas polides. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>GODAY Muses Leweta gishshas immida azazoza mala derezi wurikka ooththides; hessa malan Leweti Aaroonenne iza nayta alaafeteththa garsan Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon ooththanaas giigettida.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24-25"/>«Leweti ooso doommanaas bessiza wogati yelettiin nam7u tammanne ichchashu layththafe biidi ichchashu tammu layth gakkanaas dizayti wuri Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon ooththetto; ichchash tammu layth kumishin ooththofetto. <verse eid="NUM 8:24-25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>Hessafe guye istta ishati Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon ooththiza wode maaddanaas dandayeettes attiin barkka xalla diikko ay oosokka ooththofetto.»<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Paaziga Ba7aale Bonchcho Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>Isra7eele asay Gibxeppe kezida nam7anththo layththan koyro aginan GODAY Muses Siina bazzon hizgi yootides, <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>«Isra7eele asay Paaziga ba7aaleza izi bonchchettiza woden bonchcho; <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>hayssa ha aginazan tammanne oydanththo gallassa omars wogaa malanne diza maaraa mala bonchcho.» <verse eid="NUM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Hessa gishshas Musey Paaziga ba7aaleza asay bonchchana mala yootides. <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>Isttika koyro aginay gelida tammanne oydanththo gallas gadey qammishin Siina bazzon Paaziga ba7aaleza bonchchida; Isra7eele asay GODAY Muse azazida mala ubbaa ooththida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Kessa 12:1-13</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Gido attiin istta garsafe hayqqida aha bochchida gishshas tunida asati istta giddon diza gishshas he gallas Paaziga ba7aaleza bonchchanaas dandaybeettenna; hessa gishshas istti Musekkonne Aaroonekko shiiqidi, <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>Muses, «Nuni aha bochchidi tunidos shin hankko Isra7eele asaappe dummason nuni iza woden GODAAS yarsho shiishshontta mala aazas digettizonii?» gida.<verse eid="NUM 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Museykka isttas, «Tani GODAAPPE izi intte gishshas azazizayssa siyana gakkanaas naagiishshite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Inttefe gidiin woykko intte zereththafe asay aha bochchidi tunikko woykko oge bidaa gidikko izaadey GODAA Paaziga ba7aale bonchchanaas dandayees. <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>Hessika nam7anththo aginay gelida tammanne oydanththo gallas gadey qammishin bonchchanaas dandayees; istti bonchchishe Paaziga dorsaa irshoy gelontta uketh camo miththa hayththara meto. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>Gadey wonttana gakkanaas he kaththaafe aykkoka ashshofetto; shukettida meheza meqeththafe issineyokka menththofetto; isttas imettida wogaa mala ba7aaleza bonchchetto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kessa 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:36">Yoha 19:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Geesh gididinne oge bontta asi oonikka Paaziga ba7aaleza bonchchiza gallas bochchonttaadey ta deraappe shaaketto; izi yarshoza bessiza woden yarshontta aggida gishshas ba nagaraas bessiza qixaate ekko.<verse eid="NUM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>« ‹Intte giddon beti yida hara dere asi GODAA Paaziga ba7aaleza bonchchana koykko diza wogaa mala ubbaa poli bonchchanaas bessees; deren yelettidayssa gidiin asa biitta as gidiin hayssa wogaza issi mala polo› gaada yoota.»<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tama Misatiza Shaara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kessa 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezi tokettida gallas shaarazi Dunkaaneza goozi oykkides; omarsafe biidi gadey wonttana gakkanaas Dunkaaneza bolla tama misatiza shaaray kammi oykkides. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>Gallas gallas shaaray kammi oykkees; he shaarazikka omars omars tama mala poo7ees. <verse eid="NUM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Shaarazi Dunkaaneza bollafe dendiza wode ubbaan Isra7eele asay ba dunkaani dizasoppe dendi bees; shaarazi eqqiza wode asaykka ba dizason dunkaani uttees. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Isra7eele asay ba dizasoppe dendi biza wode gidiin istti harason dunkaani uttiza wode GODAY istta azazida mala haneettes; shaarazi Dunkaaneza bolla wodhdhidi kammi oykkida wode ubbaan istti bantti dunkaani uttidasohon gam7eettes. <verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Shaarazi Dunkaaneza bolla daro gallas gam7ikokka istti GODAAS azazeteththan heen ba dunkaani dizason gam7eettes attiin awakka qaaxxettenna. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Issi issi wode shaarazi Dunkaaneza bolla guuththa gallassata xalla gam7ees; gidikkoka heen gadaan istti gam7iko woykko gede sinththe biikko GODAY istta azazida mala haneettes. <verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Shaarazi issi issi wode gadey wonttana gakkanaas xalla gam7ees; gadey wontishin shaarazi dendida mala heerakka hemeth doommeettes; woykko shaarazi gallas gidiin omars dendiza wode isttika dendi beettes. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Nam7u gallas gidiin woykko issi agina gidiin woykko issi layththika gidiin hessafekka adussa wode shaarazi Dunkaaneza bolla kammi uttida wode ubbaan isttika bantti dunkaani dizasoppe qaaxxettenna; gido attiin shaarazi dendi biza wode isttika dendi hemeth doommeettes. <verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Istti dunkaani uttizay woykko ba dizasoppe dendi bizay GODAY Muses immida azazoza mala.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Birappe Oosettida Zayeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>«Dereza issi bolla shiishshanaas gidiin woykko asay dunkaani dizasoppe denththeththanaas punniza nam7u zayeta birappe qoxxa kessa. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Nam7u zayeti punettiza wode kumeththa maabaray Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza pengen ne dizaso shiiqo. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Issi zayey zayettiza wode gidikko Isra7eele asaappe korapinneti xalla neekko shiiqetto. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Zayeza dhoqqu histti zaykko arshey mokkiza baggara dunkaani uttida asay koyro hemeth doommo. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Ne zayeza nam7anththo dhoqqu histta punniza wode dugeha baggara dunkaani uttida asay hemeth doommo; zayey dhoqqu gi zayetiza wode asay hemeth doommanaas malata gido. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Deraa issi bolla shiishshanaas zayeta dhoqqisontta ziqqi histta zaya. <verse eid="NUM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>Qeese gidida Aaroone nayti zayeta punnetto; hessika inttes naa naa gakkanaas eqqi diza woga gido.<verse eid="NUM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>«Intte deraa bolla worajjida intte morkketara intte olettanaas keziza wode zayeta dhoqqu histti punnite; histtiko GODAA intte Xoossay inttena qoppananne intte morkketappe inttena ashshana. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>Hessaththoka intte ufayssa ba7aale gallas, hessika agina ba7aaletanne dumma dumma intte bonchchanaas qachchida ba7aaleta bonchchiza wode xuugettiza yarshonne issifeteththa yarshota shiishshiza wode zayeta punnite; heyti Xoossa sinththan inttena qofsana; tani GODAA intte Xoossaa.»<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Siinappe Isra7eele Asaa Buus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Derezi Gibxe dereppe kezida nam7anththo layththan nam7anththo aginay gelida nam7u tammanththo gallas Markkateththa Dunkaanezappe bollara diza shaarazi dendides. <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>Isra7eele asay Siina bazzofe dendidi shaarazi Paaraane bazzon eqqana gakkanaas dumma dummason shempida. <verse eid="NUM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>Isra7eele asay GODAY kase Muse azazida azazoza mala koyro yuusho hemeth doommides. <verse eid="NUM 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Yuhuda qommota bandira garsan diza Aminadaabe naa Ne7asooney kaaleththiin ba butte tara naagidi koyro bida. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Yisakoore zarkketa kaaleththizay Xu7aare naa Natina7eele. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Zaabiloone zarkketa kaaleththizay Heloone naa Elyaabe. <verse eid="NUM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/>Hessafe guye dunkaanezi shodettiin Dunkaaneza tookkidayti Gershoone qommotinne Meraare zarkketi buus doommida.<verse eid="NUM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Istta kaallidi Oroobeele zarkketa bandira garsan dizayti Shaadure naa Elxuurey kaaleththiin ba tara naagidi bida. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Simoona zarkketa kaaleththizay Xurshadaye naa Salum7eele. <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Gaade zarkketa kaaleththizay Da7u7eele naa Elyaasaafe.<verse eid="NUM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/>Hessafe guye Lewe bagga as gidida Qa7aate zarkke gididayti geeshsha miishshata tookki ekkidi bida; istti baappe sinththa baggan diza heeraza gakkanaappe kase Xoossa dunkaanezi toletti uttees.<verse eid="NUM 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Hessafe kaallidi Efreeme zarkketa bandira garsan dizayti Amihuude naa Elshamay kaaleththiin ba tara naagidi bida. <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Minaase zarkketa kaaleththizay Pedaxuure naa Gamal7eele. <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>Biniyaame zarkketa kaaleththizay Gidi7oone naa Abidaane. <verse eid="NUM 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Wurseththan ha butteta guye tuchchan naagiza Daane zarkketa bandira garsan dizayti ba tara naagidi bida; Daane qommota kaaleththizay Amishadaye naa Ahi7ezeere. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Aaseere zarkketa kaaleththizay Okra naa Fagu7eele; <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Niftaaleme zarkketa kaaleththizay Enaane naa Ahire. <verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay kase ba dizasoppe kezidi ba butten butten biza buussaa maaray hayssa mala.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Musey ba machchey aawa Midiyaame dere as Era7u7eele naa Hobaabes, «Hekko nuni GODAY nuus immanaas kase caaqqida dere baanaas giigettidos; GODAY Isra7eele asaa duresanaas kase nuus caaqqi woththides; hessa gishshas nekka nunara hedhdha; nuni nees lo7o ooththana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Hobaabey, «Akkay! Kase tani yelettida derenne ta dabbotakko simma baana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Musey izas, «Ne nuuppe shaaketta booparkkii! Nuni hayssa bazzo biittan bishe awan awan shempana bessizaakko neni eraasa; neni nuna oge kaaleththiza as gidana. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Neni nunara biikko GODAY nuus immiza lo7o miishsha ubbaafe nu nees shaakki immana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Derezi geeshsha zumay diza Siina bazzo yeggidi heedzdzu gallassa oge bides; heedzdzu gallassatan GODAA Caaqo Qaala Taabotazi asay shempanaaso koyanaas asappe sinththati bides; istti kase ba diza heeraa yeddanaappe kasetidi asay shempanaaso koyanaas Caaqo Qaalaa Taabotazi isttafe sinththan sinththan bides. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Istti ba dizasoppe dendi dendi bishin GODAA shaaray gallas gallas istta kammi oykkees. <verse eid="NUM 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Caaqo Qaalaa Taabotay baana dendishin dendishin Musey, «GODAWU! Nekka denda; ne morkketi laalettetto; nena ixxizayti wurikka ne sinththafe kichchetto!» gees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:1">Maza 68:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Caaqo Qaala Taabotazi issiso gakki eqqiza wode, «Ta GODAWU! Daro shiyan qoodettiza Isra7eele asaakko ne ayfeso haa zaara» gees. <figure style="fig" alt="Priests walking with carring covenant" file="LB00283B.TIF" size="span" ref="10:36">Qeeseti caaqo qaala taabota tookki bishin</figure><verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Tama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Isra7eele asay ba bolla gakkida meto ubbaa gishshas GODAA bolla zuuzumides; GODAY asaa zuuzunththaa waasoza siyidi keehi hanqettides; istta bollaka xuuggiza tama yeddides; he GODAA tamay asay dunkaani uttidasohoppe gaxara amardayssa mides. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Asaykka bana GODAARA giigsana mala Musekko waassides; Museykka GODAA woossiin tamazi to7ides. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>Xoossa tamay heen istta giddon eexxida gishshas he sohoy, «Tabeere»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tabeere: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tabeere: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tabeere guussa birsheththay, «Tamay eexxees» guussa.</char></note> geetettides.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gafida Gishshas Asaa Zuuzunth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Isra7eele asaara walaketti kezidi biza hara dumma dumma dere asay asho maanaas daro amottides; Isra7eele asaykka, «Nuni maana asho awappe demminoo! <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>Kase nu Gibxen diza wode aykko miish qanxxontta coo mela miza mole ashoy, lelehey, lelehe misatiza habbihabbey, dono misatiza kuraatey, sunkurtoynne tuumoy nuna laamoththees. <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>Ha7i gidikko manna xallay nuna saleththides; qoodheykka kath ixxides; mannafe attiin hara nu be7iza kaththi baawa» gi yeekkides.<verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>Mannay deebbo ayfe mala guuththa; izas medhay booxxi ekkiza shida mala gididi galal7o misatees. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Asay hessa yuuyi yuuyi maxees; iza woxan gaaccidi woykko udulan caddidi guuththa xaaron munuqidi uukkees; mishin izi doonan zaytera gindetti uukettida ukeththa mala mal7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:31">Kessa 16:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/>Omars omars istti dunkaani dizaso heeran xaazay wodhdhishin mannay izara issife wodhdhees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:13-15">Kessa 16:13-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Derezi wurikka ba dunkaane pengen pengen baso asaara asaara eqqidi yeekkishin Musey siyides; Xoossi istta bolla hanqettida gishshas Musey keehi ceecides. <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>Izi GODAA, «Hayssa deexo meto nees aylle gidida ta bolla ays ehadii? Neni hayssa ha dereza ubbaa deexo tooho tana ne toossanaas ta nena ay mishisadinaa? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>Buro dhanth dhammiza naa dichchiza he guuththa naaza idimmiza mala tani istta idimmada neni kase aawatas caaqqida biittaa gaththana mala ne tana ooththizay haytantta wursa shaariday tanee? Woykko istta ta yeladinaa? <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>Istti tana, ‹Nuus asho imma› giidi taakko yiidi yeekkiza gishshas hayssa asaa ubbaas gidana asho ta awappe ehoo? <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/>Tani tarkka hayssa deraa kaaleththanaas dandaykke; hayssi alaafeteththazi tana keehi deexxides. <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Ne tana hayssaththo waayisanaappe tani meto be7ontta mala ne taas mishettizaa gidikko ne tana ha7i wodhidaakko taas lo7o» gi woossides.<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Laappun Tammu Cimata Dooreteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>GODAY Muses, «Dereza ayssana dandayza erettida laappun tammu cimata doora; neni istta shiishshada Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezakko ehada ne achchan essa. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>Tanikka hee wodhdhada nenara haasayana; tani nees immida ayanaappe isttas shaakka immana; hessafe guye istti dereza nees diza alaafeteththaafe shaakki ekkidi dereza tooho tookki nena maaddana; hayssafe guye hayssa alaafeteththaa ne xalla tookkaka. <verse eid="NUM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>Ha7ikka derezas, ‹Wontos inttena geeshshite; inttes maana ashoy daana; intte nuni maana asho nuus oonee immanay giidi yeekkidayssanne nuus Gibxey lo7o gidayssa GODAY siyides; hekko ha7i inttes GODAY asho immana; intteka iza maandeta. <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Intte asho maanay issi gallas woykko nam7u gallas woykko ichchashu gallas woykko tammu gallas woykko nam7u tammu gallas xalla gidenna. <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>Izi inttena saleththidi inttes siidhera kezana gakkanaas agina kumeth intte iza maana; hessika hananay intte hayssa intte giddon diza GODAA kadhida gishshassinne nuni Gibxeppe kase kezontta aggidaakko nuus lo7okkoshin giidi intte yeekkida gishshassa› » gides.<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Musey GODAAS, «Hekko ha7i tani kaaleththizay usuppun xeetu shii asa;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Asa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Asa gizayssi maccassatanne nayta gujjenna.</char></note> ‹Neni aginas gidana asho isttas immana› gaada qaala geladasa. <verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>Histtiin hayssa asaas ay keena mehey shukettiin gidanee? Abba giddon diza moley ubbay issi bolla shiiqidaakko gidandee?» gi oychchides.<verse eid="NUM 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>GODAY Muses, «Taas Xoossas wolqqay guuththee? Ta qaalay intte achchan polettanaakkonne agganaakko ne ha7i be7ana» gi zaarides.<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Hessa gishshas Musey kezidi GODAY izas gidayssa ubbaa derezas yootides; dereza kaaleththizaytappe laappun tammu as issiso shiishshidi dunkaaneza yuushon essides. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>GODAYKKA shaarara wodhdhidi izas yootides; Muses immida ayanaappe shaakkidi deraa kaaleththiza laappun tammu cimata bolla woththides; ayanay istta bolla wodhdhiin istti bantta qaala dhoqqu histtidi nabeta mala tinbite haasayda; istti hessa nam7anththibeettenna.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Mazgabettida laappun tammu deraa kaaleththizayta giddofe nam7ati Eldaadenne Medaade geetettizayti gede Dunkaanezakko bontta bantti diza heeran gam7ida; istti heen dishin ayanay istta bolla wodhdhiin isttika ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi nabeta mala tinbite haasayda. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Issi naateththa asi Musekko woxxi biidi, «Eldaadeynne Medaadey heen bantta heeran dishe tinbite haasayeettes» gi yootides. <verse eid="NUM 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Naateththafe doommidi Muse ooththi maaddiza Nawe naa Iyaasoy, «Ta godaa Musee! Haytanti tinbite haasayontta mala teqqa!» gides. <verse eid="NUM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Museykka izas, «Ne taas mishettada hessa gay? Tani gidikko Xoossi hayssa deraa ubbaa bolla ba ayana woththikonne ubbayka ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi nabeta mala tinbite haasaydaakko hessi taas ufayssa!» gides. <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Museynne Isra7eele asaa kaaleththiza laappun tammu asay gede ba dizaso simmides.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Goday Kuracho Misatiza Kafo Yeddides</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>Hessafe guye GODAY carko denththidi abba giddofe kuracho misatiza kafo asay dunkaani uttida heera ehides; histtidi he kafota biittafe pude nam7u wadha keena dhoqqu giidi piradhdhi yiidi asay dunkaani uttida heera yuushon issi gallassa oge keena gidizaason biitta bolla may7i uttida. <verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Hessa gishshas he gallassinne omars, hessaththoka wonteththa gallassika derezi he kafota oykki shiishshides; issi asikka tammu kiloppe pace oykkibeenna; izikka melana mala ba dunkaanida heera yuusho ubbaan miccida. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Gido attiin istti buro coommi mittontta dishin GODAY deraa bolla keehi hanqettides; GODAY gita boshakka deraa bolla yeddides. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Asho amottidi hayqqida asaa heen gadaan moogida gishshas he gadeza sunththi, «Kibroote-Hatta7aabe»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kibroote-Hatta7aabe: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kibroote-Hatta7aabe guussi Amo Duufo guussa.</char></note> geetettides. <verse eid="NUM 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Asay Kibroote-Hatta7aabe gede Haxiroote biidi heen dunkaani uttides.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Bolla Maaraminne Aaroone Dendo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Musey Tophphiyappe machcho ekkida gishshas Maaramanne Aarooney zigirsan iza hizgi kadhida, <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>«GODAY Muse baggara xalla haasaydee? Nu baggara haasaybeennee?» GODAY istti gidayssa ubbaaka siyides. <verse eid="NUM 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Musey gidikko biitta bolla diza asaa ubbaafe aadhdhida ashke asa.<verse eid="NUM 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Heerakka GODAY Muse, Aaroonenne Maaramo, «Intte heedzdzay Gaytoteththa dunkaanekko haa yiite!» gides; isttika bida. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Histtiin GODAY tuus misatiza shaara giddora wodhdhidi Dunkaaneza pengen eqqidi, «Haysso Aaroone! Hanne Maaramee!» gi xeygides; Nam7atikka gede iza sinth shiiqida. <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>GODAY isttas, «Hekko ha7i ta inttena gizayssa akeeki siyite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">«Intte giddon nabeti diikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">tani tana isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">ajjuutan qonccisays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">agumon istta haasayssays.<verse eid="NUM 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Tani taas haggaziza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">Musera gidikko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">hessa malan haasaykke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">izi ta keeththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">ammanettida asa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:2">Ib 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>Hessa gishshas tani izara sinththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">qonccera haasayays attiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">guyera qotan haasaykke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">izi ta medha beyees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">histtiin intte ta oosanchchaza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">Muse bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">waani yayyontta kadhe qaala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">haasaydetii?» gides.<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>GODAA hanqoy istta bolla tama mala eexxi kezides; izikka istta heen aggi bides. <verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Shaarazi dunkaaneza bollafe dendi biin Maarama inchchirachcha harganchcha gidadus; inchchirachcha hargezikka izi bolla shachcha mala booththides; Aarooney Maaramo beyishin iza izas inchchirachcha harganchcha gida beettadus. <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>Aarooney Muses, «Ta godoo! Nuni ne bolla ooththida nagaraa gaason hayssi iita qixaatey nu bolla polettana mala ooththofarkkii! <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Izakka ba aayi ulon hayqqada izis bagga asateththay meetettichchiin yelettida awucaya naa mala ooththofarkkii!» gides. <verse eid="NUM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Hessa gishshas Musey, «Xoossawu! Izo paththarkkii!» giidi pude GODAAKKO waassides.<verse eid="NUM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>GODAYKKA Muses, «Izi aaway ayfeson cuch cuttidaarakka yeellatada laappun gallas gakkanaas gam7a erekkee? Hessa gishshas iza asay diza heeraappe kezada laappun gallas gakkanaas asi bayndason takkaashshu; hessafe guye asay dizaso gelanaas dandayawus» gi zaarides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 5:2-3">Tay 5:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Hessa gishshas Maarama asi diza gutappe kare kezada laappun gallas gakkanaas bana genththadus; iza heeppe simmana gakkanaas derezi ba dizasoppe haraso qaaxxibeenna. <verse eid="NUM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Hessafe guye asay Haxirooteppe dendidi Paaraane bazzon dunkaani uttides.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kanaane Dere Xomosi Xeellanaas Bida Asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Zaare 1:19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/>«Tammanne nam7u Isra7eele asaa garsafe dere kaaleththizayta doorada tani Isra7eele asaas immana gida Kanaane biittayo xomosi xeellidi yaana mala yedda.» <verse eid="NUM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Museykka GODAY iza azazida mala Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizayta giddofe Paaraane bazzofe tammanne nam7u asata yeddides. <verse eid="NUM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>He asata sunththayka hayssafe kaallizayssa; Oroobeele zarkkefe Zakure naa Shaamu7e, <verse eid="NUM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Simoona zarkkefe Hoore naa Saafaaxe <verse eid="NUM 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Yuhuda zarkkefe Yoofine naa Kaalebe, <verse eid="NUM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Yisakoore zarkkefe Yooseefe naa Yigi7aale, <verse eid="NUM 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Efreeme zarkkefe Nawe naa Hose7e, <verse eid="NUM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Biniyaame zarkkefe Eraafo naa Palixe, <verse eid="NUM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Zaabiloone zarkkefe Sade naa Gadu7eele; <verse eid="NUM 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Yooseefe zarkkefe Minaase bagga gidida Suse naa Gaadeye, <verse eid="NUM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Daane zarkkefe Gamaale naa Am7eele, <verse eid="NUM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Aaseere zarkkefe Mika7eele naa Sature <verse eid="NUM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Niftaaleme zarkkefe Wafise naa Nahibe, <verse eid="NUM 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Gaade zarkkefe Makke naa Ga7u7eele.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Heyti dereza hanota xomosi xeellidi yaana mala Musey kiittidayta; Nawe naa Hose7e, «Iyaaso» giidi iza sunththaa laammides.<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Musey istta kiitti yeddishe, «Intte bishe Negebe baggara aadhdhidi pude gezze biitta biite. <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>He dereya ay misatizaakko, ay keena asi izin dizaakko qasseka asaa minoteththi ay malakko xomosi xeellidi yiite. <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>He biittaya iitakkonne lo7okko asay diza katamaya gimbetta uttidaakko woykko gimbettontta coo mela dizaakko xomosi xeellite. <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>Biittaya modhdhokonne qallako, worakkonne coo dizaakko xomosi xeellite; minnite! He biittan diza miththa ayfetappe ekki yiite» gides; istti hee bida wodey woyne miththa ayfey teeriza wode.<verse eid="NUM 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Hessa gishshas he wode asay pudeha bagga dere bides; he derezan diza Xiine bazzofe doommidi gede Hamaate aadhdhi bizasoza matan diza Erahoobe gakkanaas yuuyi xeellida. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>Koyro gede Negebe biidi heera Kebroone gakkida; Kebrooneykka, «Enaaqe» geetettiza geesanne gubba gita asata zereth gidida Ahimaane, Shashayenne Talimaye geetettiza zarkketi diza biitta. [Kebrooney Gibxen diza Xaanoose katamayppe laappun layth sinththata eqqadus.] <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>Istti heera aadhdhidi gede Eshkoole shoobba gakkida; heeppeka woyne miththa ayfera diza hagga qanxxi ekkidi he woyne miththaa ayfeppe issi wurco issaadey barkka tookkanaas dandayontta deexo gidida gishshas nam7u asati miththan aaththi tookkida; izara issife oroomaane miththa ayfenne balase miththa ayfe ekki yida. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>Hessi he sohozi, «Eshkoole<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraaweta qaalara Eshkoole guussi, «Woyne ayfe wurco» guussa.</char></note> shoobba» geetettida gaasoykka Isra7eele asay woyne miththaa iza ayfe wurcozara gaththi qanxxi ekkidi yidaso gidida gishshassa. <verse eid="NUM 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Istti biittayo oyddu tammu gallas xomosi xeellidaappe guye aggi simmida.<verse eid="NUM 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanaane Dere Xomosi Xeellanaas Bida Asati Shiishshida Qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>Paaraane bazzon Qaadeesen diza Musekko, Aaroonekkonne Isra7eele maabara kumeththaakko simmi yiidi bantti beydayssa ubbaa qonccisi yootida; bantti ekki yida miththa ayfezakka istta bessida. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>Istti Muses, «Nuni biittayo xomosi be7idi addafekka iza maaththinne eessi kumida dure dere gididaaro nu shaakki eridos; he biittaya immiza ayfeza hayssa beya. <verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Gido attiin he dereyin diza asay daro mino; hessafe bollara istta katamatikka daro gitatanne gimbey yuuyi aadhdhidayta; hessi hessa gidishin asay qasse geesanne gubba gita gidida Enaaqe zereththata nu beydos. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Amaaleeqe asay Negeben dishin, Hiite asay, Yaabuse asaynne Amoore asay bolla gezze biittan Kanaane asay qasse Yordaanoose haaththa gaxaninne Mediteraane abba achchan deettes» gi yootida.<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Kaalebey qasse Muse sinththan asaa co7u histtidi, «Nuni istta xoonanaas nuus gidiza wolqqay diza gishshas nuni ha7i biidi he biittayo ane oykkoos» gides. <verse eid="NUM 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Kaalebera bida asati qasse, «Nuni istta bolla meto gaththanaas mulekka nuus wolqqay baawa; he deraan diza asay nuuppe daro mino» gida. <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>Istti xomosi xeellana bida dereza gishshas Isra7eele asaas ehi yootida yo7oy asaas diza hidota qanxxisiza yo7o; istti qasseka, «Nuni izo xomosi xeellida biittaya izin daanaas biza as mittiza biitta; nuni heen beyda asaykka geesanne gubba gita. <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>Nefleeme bagga gidida Enaaqe nayta nuni heen beydos; nuni istta achchan qeeri gumbaro misatidos; isttika nuna hessaththo xeellontta aggettenna» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:4">Medhe 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Bolla Dereza Denth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Derezi he gallassa omars kumeth ba qaala dhoqqu histtidi waassishe aqides; <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>Kumeththa Isra7eele maabaray Muse bollanne Aaroone bolla zuuzumishe, «Nuni kase heen Gibxen dishe woykko hayssa ha bazzo biittan hayqqidaakko nuus lo7okkoshin! <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>GODAY nuna hinno he dereyo aazas efizee? Nuni wurikka olan wuranaas doos; nu machchetinne nu naytikka di7ettana; hessafe nuni duge Gibxe simmiko nuus lo7ana» gida. <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>Hessa gishshas istti ba garsan issoy issaara, «Ane haa yiite! Nuna kaaleththana as dooridi ane aggi guye Gibxe simmoos» gi haasayettida.<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>He wode Museynne Aarooney kumeththa deraa sinththan biitta bolla gufannida. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Biittayo xomosanaas kiitettida asatappe Nawe naa Iyaasoynne Yoofine naa Kaalebey yo7ozan daro ceecidi bantta may7oza daakkida. <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>Istti derezas, «Nuni biidi yuuyi xomosi xeellida biittaya keeha lo7o biitta. <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>GODAY nunan ufayettidaa gidikko izi nuna hee efana; eessinne maaththi izin kumida gasa biittayo izi nuus immana. <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Intte gidikko GODAA bolla makkallofte! Heen diza derezaska babofte! Nuni istta qiison xoonana; GODAY nunara dees; istta bollafe eeshoy dendichchida gishshas intte isttas mulekka babbofte!» gida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:16">Ib 3:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Istta shuchchara caddi wodhanaas kumeththa maabaray istta bolla dendides; gido attiin GODAA bonchchoy Isra7eele asaa kumeththaas Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan qonccides.<verse eid="NUM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Musey Derezas Woossida Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>GODAY Muses, «Hayssi derezi ayde gakkanaas tana kadhanee? Tani dereza sinththan daro malaata ooththadis; histtiin derezi tanan ammanettontta ayde gakkanaas ixxanee? <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>Hekko ha7i tani iita harge istta bolla ehada istta ubbaa wursana; nena gidikko isttafe aadhdhiza mino kawoteththas aawasana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>Musey gidikko GODAAS, «Neni hayssa dereza ne wolqqan Gibxeppe kessadasa; neni hayssa ne dereza bolla ooththidayssa Gibxe asay siyida wode,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">Kessa 32:11-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>hessa hanida yo7o ubbaa hayssa derezan diza asaa kumeththas istti yootana; hayti ha asati neni GODAY nunara dizayssanne shaaray nuuppe bollara qonccen beettiza mala neni gallas gallas shaara mala tuussan omars omars tama mala tuussan gidada nuuppe sinththe aadhdha kaaleththizayssa siyishe gam7ida. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Histtiin ne ha7i ne asaa wursa wodhikko ne goobateththaa siyida kawoteth ubbay, <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>nena, ‹Izi ba dereza gelththana giidi kase caaqqida caaqoza polanaas dandayontta aggida gishshas istta bazzon wodhi dhayssides› gaana. <verse eid="NUM 14:16"/><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17-18"/>Godoo hayssafe kase neni, ‹GODAY elle hanqetti erenna; iza maaroteththaynne iza siiqoy daro; izi nagaranne geellateththaa atto gaana; gido attiin naytanne isttas nayta nayta gakkanaas istti yelidayta nagara gishshas ta istta qaxxayana› gida mala polada ne wolqqa bessa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5-6">Kessa 20:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:6-7">34:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:9-10">Zaare 5:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:17-18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Ha7ikka Godoo! Laamettontta ne gita siiqozan istti Gibxeppe kezoosofe hanno gakkanaas ne istta maarida mala hayssa deraa nagara ne maarana mala ta nena woossays» gides.<verse eid="NUM 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>GODAYKKA Muses, «Ne tana oychchida mala ta istta maaradis. <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>Gido attiin tani de7on diza malanne ta bonchchoy biitta ubbaan kumida mala, <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>tani isttas Gibxeninne hayssa bazzo biittan ooththida gita malaatanne ta bonchchoza be7idi taas azazettontta ixxidaytappenne tammuto tana paaccida asatappe oonikka, <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>tani kase istta aawatas immana gaada caaqqida biittayo istti mulekka gelettenna; tana kadhiday oonikka izo mulera be7enna. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Gido attiin ta oosanchcha Kaalebes hankkoytappe dumma qofay izas diza gishshassinne izi tana kumeththa wozinappe kaallida gishshas izi biidi kase yuuyi xeellida biittayo ta izas immana; iza zereththatikka he biittayo laattana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:9-12">Iya 14:9-12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>Amaaleeqe dere asaynne Kanaane dere asay shoobba giddon diza gishshas intte wonto guye simmidi Zo7o abba baggara efiza ogezara gede bazzo simmi biite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuuzumidayta Qaxxayeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>GODAY Musessinne Aaroones hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>«Hayti iita asati ayde gakkanaas ta bolla zuuzumanee? Ha zuuzumettiza Isra7eele asay ta bolla zuuzumettishin ta siyadis. <verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>Ne isttas, ‹Tani ta de7o sunththan caaqqays; tani intte haasayshin ta hayththan siyida mala intte bolla ooththana; tani GODAY hayssa yootadis. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/>Intte ta bolla zuuzumettida gishshas intte garsafe qoodettishin layththay nam7u tammunne izappe bollara gididayta ubbaa ahay hayssa bazzo biittan kundi attana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:17">Ib 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>Intte he dereyo gelidi de7ana mala kase ta inttes caaqqadis; gido attiin Yoofine naa Kaalebeppenne Nawe naa Iyaasoppe attiin inttefe issaadeyka he biittayo gelenna. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Di7ettidi attana geetettida intte nayta intte kadhida biittayo ta gelththana; he biittayo ta istta laatissana. <verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Intte ahay gidikko hayssa ha bazzozan kundi attana. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Intte nayti intte ammanontta ixxida gaason inttefe wurseththan hayqqizaade ahay bazzo biittan kundi attana gakkanaas 40 layth kumeth gita meto ekkishe hayssa ha bazzozan toylattana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:36">Hawa 7:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Intte he biittaa xomosi xeellida 40 gallassaa qoodan issi gallassayo issi layth, hessika oyddu tammu layth kumeth intte intte nagaraa gishshas waayettana; tani intte intte bolla dendidayssa intte hessan erana. <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>Ta bolla dendida iita asata bolla tani hayssa ubbaa ooththana; hayssa bazzozan ubbatikka wuri wurana; ubbatikka hayqqana; tani GODAY hayssa yootadis› ga yoota.» <verse eid="NUM 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>Musey Kanaane biittayo xomosi xeellanaas kiitti yeddida asati biidi biittayo beyi simmidaappe guye he biittay gishshas iita wore ehidi derezi ba garsan zuuzumettana mala ooththida. <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>He asati GODAA sinththan boshan shocetti hayqqida. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>He biittayo biidi xomosi xeellida asata giddofe Nawe naa Iyaasoynne Yoofine naa Kaalebey xalla shemppora paxa attida.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanaane Biitta Bolla Dendida Koyro Worajja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Zaare 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>GODAY gidayssa Musey Isra7eele asaas yootiin asay camo yeeho yeekkides. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Wonteththa gallas wontta maaladora istti dendidi pude gezzetizaso kezanaas giigettidi, «Nuni nagara ooththoyssaka zaari akeekidos; ha7i gidikko nuni kase Xoossi nuna gelththana gi hidota immida dereyo baanaas giigettidos» gida.<verse eid="NUM 14:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Musey gidikko isttas, «Histtiin intte GODAAS ha7ikka ays azazeteketii? Intte qoppidayssi inttes suurenna. <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>Hessa gishshas intte hee boopite GODAY inttenara gidontta gishshas intte morkketi inttena xoonana. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Amaaleeqe asaynne Kanaane asay inttenara heen olettana; gido attiin intte GODAA aggida gishshassinne izi inttenara baynda gishshas intte he olaan hayqqana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 14:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>Muse gidiin Caaqo Qaala Taabotazi kase ba diza heeraappe dendontta dishin istti pude gezze biittayo olanaas xalateththan dendida. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Hessafe guye he deren diza Amaaleeqe asaynne Kanaane asay istta bolla meto gaththidi xoonida Horma gakkanaas gooddi yeddida.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yarsho Gishshas Gujetti Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Ta inttes immana qoppida biittayo intte gelida wode, <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>xuugettiza yarshos woykko adina gishshas yarshettana yarshos woykko asi ba lo7o qofappe shiishshiza yarsho gishshas, woykko lose ba7aaleta wode shiiqiza yarshota miizappe woykko dorsafe GODAAS intte shiishshandeta; hessa misatiza yarshoy GODAA sawiza yarsho gidana. <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/>Hessa gishshas hessa mala shiishshiza asi wuri issi litiro gidana zayten issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiillefe munuqettida kaththa yarsho shiishshanaas bessees. <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>Qasse xuugettiza yarshos woykko hara yarshos ehiza issi issi dorsa laaqqara issi litiro woyne ushsha yarsho shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>« ‹Dharsho yarshos shiishshiza wode qasse nam7u kilo dhiille issi litironne sayso gidiza wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>Ushsha yarshos issi litironne sayso gidiza woyne ushshu shiishsha; hessi wurikka lo7o GODAA sawizaazinne ufayssizaaz gidana;<verse eid="NUM 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>« ‹Neni issi mirgo adinas, woykko issifeteththa yarshos, woykko xuugettiza yarshos, woykko hara yarshos shiishshiza wode, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>he mirgozara heedzdzu kilo gidiza liiqo dhiillefe nam7u litiro zayten munuqettida kaththa yarsho shiishsha. <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>Hessaththoka ushsha yarshos nam7u litiro gidiza woyne ushshu shiishsha; hessika GODAA ufayssiza, sawizaazanne xuugettiza yarsho gidana. <verse eid="NUM 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>Hessa gishshas issi issi mirgo, woykko issi issi dharsho woykko dharsho laaqqa woykko korbe laaqqa yarshos shiishshiza wode issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshoy hessa. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Issi meheppe bollara shiiqiza wode izara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshoy hessa mala gujettees. <verse eid="NUM 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>Deren yelettida Isra7eele asaappe issoy issoy xuugettiza yarshonne sawoy GODAA ufayssiza yarsho shiishshiza wode hessaththo ooththanaas bessees. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Sinththafe yaana yeletaan inttenara diza bete asi woykko intte garsan diza hara dere asi oonikka xuugettiza yarsho woykko GODAA ufayssiza kaththa yarsho GODAAS shiishshana koykko izaadeyka intte ooththizayssa mala ooththanaas bessees. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Intte ubbatikka intte giddon diza asa dere asatikka hayssafe yaana layththatan ubbatan hayta wogata issi mala naaganaas inttes bessees; intteninne istti ubbati GODAA sinththan issino. <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>Inttessinne inttenara diza hara dere asaa ubbaas diza wogaynne maaray issino gido› ga yoota.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:22">Lewe 24:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Ta inttena kaaleththiza biittayo intte geliza wode, <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>he biittayn kaxxiza kath ubbaa miza wode he kaththaafe GODAAS imota immite. <verse eid="NUM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>Hessika koyro dhiillezappe uketh uukkidi baleppe imettida yarsho ooththidi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Buroppe yaana yeleta ubbaan koyro dhiillezappe ekkidi GODAAS imota shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>« ‹GODAY Muses immida azazotappe issaa intte erontta moorizaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>woykko sinththafe yaana yeletati Muse baggara imettida azazoza polontta aggiko, <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>hessa mala balay maabaray erontta hanikko issi mirgo ehidi GODAA sawidi ufayssiza yarshonne xuugettiza yarsho izas shiishshetto; wogazi azaziza mala kaththa yarshonne ushsha yarsho izara issi bolla gaththi shiishshetto; hessafekka bollara issi deysha orge nagara yarshos shiishshetto. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Qeesezi kumeththa Isra7eele maabaraa nagara wurso; istti erontta ooththida nagara gaason xuugettiza yarshonne kaththa yarsho shiishshida gishshas istta nagaray atto geetettana. <verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>Ubbayka erontta dishe nagara ooththida gishshas Isra7eele asaa woykko istta giddon diza hara dere asaa nagaray atto geetettana.<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>« ‹Issi asi erontta nagara ooththiko issi layththa deysha laaqqa ba nagara gishshas yarshos shiishsho. <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>Erontta dishe nagara ooththidaades iza nagaray atto geetettana mala qeesezi GODAA sinththan iza nagaraa wurso; iza nagaraykka atto geetettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27-28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:27-31">Lewe 4:27-31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Isra7eele deren yelettida Isra7eele asi woykko istta giddon diza asa dere asi erontta dishe nagara ooththidaa gidikko ubbaas diza wogay issi mala.<verse eid="NUM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>« ‹Gido attiin Isra7eele dere as woykko hara dereppe beti istta giddo yida asi wozinay erishin nagara ooththida asi wurikka GODAA leqqida gishshas derezappe shaaketti dhayo. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>Izaadey GODAA leqqida gishshassinne iza azazota erishe moorida gishshas mulera dhayo; iza gomey izara bo› ga yoota.»<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambata Woga Menththidi Qaxxayettida As</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Isra7eele asay bazzon diza wode issi gallas issaadey sambata gallas mith mixishe oykettides. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>He iza oykkida asati iza oykki ekkidi Musekko, Aaroonekkonne kumeththa maabaray dizaso efida. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>Isttika iza wosttanaakkonne erettontta ixxiin guuththa wodes qashettiishana mala zabes imettides. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses, «He addezi hayqqo! Kumeththa maabaray dizasoppe iza kare kessidi shuchchara caddi wodho» gides. <verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>Hessa gishshas kumeththa maabaray bantti diza gutappe haraso efidi GODAY azazida mala shuchchara kurakki wodhides.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">May7o Macara Gishshas Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Intte may7iza may7os macara kessite; issi issi macaray salo misatiza xilatappe gido; hessaka intte buroppe yaana yeleta ubbaankka aggofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 22:12">Zaare 22:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>He macarata intte be7iza wode ubbaan ta azazota hassa7i ekkidi polite; histtiko intte intte ayfen be7idayssanne intte wozinan amottidayssa kaallidi taappe shaaketteketa. <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>May7ota xeeran diza macarata intte be7iza wode ta azazota ubbaa polana mala istti inttena qofsana; intteka mulera taas haarettidayta gidana. <verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Tani intte GODAA; inttes Godaa gidanaas inttena Gibxeppe kessida Xoossay tana› ga yoota.»<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Muse Bolla Dendida Asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Lewe zarkke Qa7aate baggafe Yixihaare naa Qoorey, Oroobeele zarkke Elyaabe nayti Daataaneynne Abraamey qasseka Palete naa Oonay meto medhdhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:11">Yuhu 11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>Isra7eele asaa garsan erettida dereza kaaleththanaas doorettida 250 asata bantta bolla ekkidi Muse bolla dendida. <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>Isttika Muse sinththaninne Aaroone sinththan shiiqidi isttas, «Intte mulekka wogappe aadhdhideta! Hayssi derezi ubbay GODAAS dummatida dere; GODAYKKA isttara dees; histtiin intte GODAA deraa bolla aazas inttena dhoqqu dhoqqu histteetii?» gida.<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Museykka hessa siyida mala gufannidi woossides. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>Qooressinne iza kaallizaytas, «Wonto maalado GODAY izas dummatidayti oonanttako izi shaakki nuna bessana; hessika baas gidizaytanne ba dooridayta baas ooththana mala baakko shiishshi ekkana. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Wonto maalado neninne nenara issife ooththizayti wurikka intte izan exaane cuwasiza xinnaza ekki yiite. <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>Istta bolla bonqo tamanne exaane woththidi gede yarsho iza bolla yarshizaso shiishshite; hessafe guye GODAY nuuppe oona baas dooridaakko nu beyana; intte Lewe nayti keehi moorideta!» gides. <verse eid="NUM 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Qasseka Musey Qoores, «Intte Leweti wozinan woththi siyite! <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>Intte gede izakko shiiqidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon intte intte ooso polana malanne intte Isra7eele asaa sinththan eqqidi isttas ooththana mala Isra7eele GODAY inttena hankko Isra7eele asaa garsafe shaakki dummasidayssa intte coo mela laafa ayfen xeelleetii! <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>Izi inttenanne hankko Lewe zarkketa baakko shiishshides; intte gidikko qeeseteththaa ekkanaas qaaqqateeta; <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>hessa gishshas neninne nenara zuppetizayti wurikka GODAA bolla dendideta; intte Aaroone bolla zuuzumettanaas izi oonee?» gides.<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Hessafe guye Musey Elyaabe nayta Daataanenne Abraame xeygisides; istti gidikko, «Nu bookko! <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>Nuni bazzon hayqqana mala ne nuna eessinne maaththi kumida biittafe kessidayssi nees guuxxiin ha7i qasse nu bolla halaqa gidanaas koyay? <verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>Neni nuna lo7o kath immiza goshsha gade ehonttayssi woykko atakiltera dizaso laatisonttayssi erettidaaza; ha7i qasse ne nuna baleththanaas koyaasa; hessa gishshas ha7i nu neekko bookko!» gida.<verse eid="NUM 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Museykka daro hanqettidi GODAAS, «Hayti asati nees shiishshiza yarshoza ne ekkofa; tani gidikko isttafe issaadeka qohabeekke; haray attoshin issi harekka isttafe ekkabeekke» gides.<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Musey Qoores, «Neninne nenara issife diza 250 asay Aarooney dizaso Gaytoteththa dunkaanekko yiite. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Inttefe issaadey issaadey intte intte xinna oykki yiite; xinnaza giddon exaane gujjite; 250 xinnatara intte intte exaaneza GODAA sinththan shiishshandeta; neninne Aarooneykka intte intte exaane exaane shiishshite» gides. <verse eid="NUM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>Hessa gishshas istti wurikka issoy issoy ba xinnan xinnan exaane gujji ekkidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaane pengen Museranne Aaroonera issife eqqida. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Hessafe guye Qoorey isttara eqettidi banara zuppetizayta Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza penge shiishshida wode GODAA bonchchoy kumeththa deraas qonccides. <verse eid="NUM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>GODAYKKA Musessinne Aaroones hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>«Hayssa deraa achchafe haakki eqqite; tani istta issito ubbaa dhayssana.»<verse eid="NUM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Museynne Aarooney sinththa guth gufannidi, «Shemppora diza medheta ubbaas Godaa gidida Xoossoo! Issi asi ooththida nagara geedon neni kumeththa deraa dhayssana gay?» giidi Xoossako waassida.<verse eid="NUM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23-24"/>GODAY Muses, «Qoore dunkaanaappe, Daataane dunkaanaappenne Abraame dunkaanaappe haakki eqqana mala neni deraas yoota» gides.<verse eid="NUM 16:23-24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Hessafe guye Musey Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizayta kaaleththi ekkidi Daataanekkonne Abraamekko bides. <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>Derezaska, «Intte hayta makkalla asata dunkaanetappe haakki eqqite; istta miish gididaaz aykkoka bochchofte; histtontta aggiko istta nagara gaason intte wurikka isttara issife pitetti dhayana» gides. <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Hessa gishshas derezi qoore dunkaanezappe; Daataane dunkaanezappenne Abraame dunkaanezappe haakki eqqides. Daataaneynne Abraameykka ba machchetaranne ba naytara ba dunkaanezappe kare kezidi ba pengen pengen eqqida.<verse eid="NUM 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>He wode Musey deraas, «Hayssa ha oosoza ooththanaas GODAY tana kiittidayssanne tanikka hayssa ooththizay ta shenen gidonttayssa intte hayssan erana. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Hayti ha asati asi hayqqiza mala hayqqizaa gidikko GODAY tana kiittibeenna. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Gido attiin asi hayththan siyi erontta ooraththa miish GODAY istta bolla ooththiin istti shemppora paxa dishe duge hayqqidayti dizaso wodhdhana mala biittaya doyettada isttanne isttas dizaaz ubbaa mittiko hayti asati GODAARA eqettidayssa intte he wode erana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Musey hessa yootida mala Daataaneynne Abrooney eqqi diza biittaya doyettada, <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>isttanne istta soo asaa, Qoore, izara zuppetiza asaanne isttas dizaaz ubbaa mittadus. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>Histtiin istti shemppora paxa dishe baas diza miishshaara duge duufon gelida; biittaya istta kammada deraa giddofe dhayssadus. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>He heeran diza Isra7eele asay he asaa waaso siyidi, «Hayssi biittay nunakka mittontta aggenna!» gi waassishe baqatides.<verse eid="NUM 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Qasseka GODAY saloppe tama yeddidi exaane cuwasiza 250 asaa xuuggides.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36"/>Hessafe guye GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37"/>«Aaroone naa El7ezeerey xarqimalappe qoxettida xinnati dumma gidida gishshas xuugettiza asata matappe istta giddon diza bonqo tamaza haahoso efi qolana mala izas yoota; <verse eid="NUM 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38"/>he xinnati GODAAS yarsho yarshizasoza shiiqida wode geeyida; hessa gishshas ba nagara gaason hayqqida asata xinna ekkada lee7isa qoxxa; histtada yarsho yarshizasozas kama ooththa; heytikka Isra7eele asay naagettana mala isttas seera malata gidana.»<verse eid="NUM 16:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39"/>Hessa gishshas El7ezeerey xinnata ekkidi yarsho yarshizasozas kama gidana mala lee7en qoxxi kessides. <verse eid="NUM 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40"/>Hessi he hanozi oonikka Aaroone zereth gidontta asi GODAAS exaane cuwasanaas yarsho yarshizasoza shiiqontta mala Isra7eele asay ubbay naagettana mala qofsiza malata gidana; hessaththo gidontta aggiko hessa mala ooththiza asi ubbayka Qoore malanne izara zuppetidayta mala dhayana; hayssi wurikka kase GODAY Muse baggara immida azazoza mala polettides.<verse eid="NUM 16:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aarooney Deraa Boshappe Ashshida Asho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41"/>Wonteththa gallas kumeththa Isra7eele maabaray, «GODAA deraa intte wodhideta» giidi Muse bollanne Aaroone bolla gugumides. <verse eid="NUM 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42"/>Derey Museranne Aaroonera eqettanaas issi bolla shiiqettida wode Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza shaaray kammi oykkiin GODAA bonchchoy izan qonccidayssa guye simmi be7idos. <verse eid="NUM 16:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43"/>Museynne Aarooney yiidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaanaas sinththa baggara eqqida. <verse eid="NUM 16:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 16:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45"/>«Hayta ha asatappe pooqqi eqqite; tani istta issito dippi histta dhayssana!» Nam7atikka duge biitta bolla gufannida.<verse eid="NUM 16:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46"/>Musey Aaroones, «Neni ne xinna ekkada yarsho yarshizasozappe bonqo tama iza bolla gujja; he tamaa bolla exaane woththa; hessafe guye eeson deraakko baada asaa nagara wursa! Hekko Xoossa hanqoy qonccida gishshas dereza giddon boshay doommides» gides. <verse eid="NUM 16:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47"/>Hessa gishshas Aarooney Musey azazida mala ba xinna ekkidi shiiqetti diza asaa giddo eeson bides; boshay deraa giddon doommidayssa be7idi exaaneza bonqo tama bolla woththidi asaa nagaraa wursides. <verse eid="NUM 16:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48"/>Aarooney paxa diza asaassinne hayqqida asaas giddon eqqidi deraa bolla yiza boshaa teqqides. <verse eid="NUM 16:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49"/>He wode hayqqida asaa qooday Qoorera issife geellateththan hayqqidayti attiin 14,700. <verse eid="NUM 16:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50"/>Boshazi eqqiin Aarooney Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza pengen diza Musekko simmi bides.<verse eid="NUM 16:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Aaroone Guufe Purcceth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>«Isra7eele asaappe zarkkefe zarkkefe korapinney issi issi guufe shiishshidi tammanne nam7u guufe immana mala oychcha; histtada issaa issaa sunth he guufeta bolla xaafa. <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>Lewe zarkketappe shiiqida guufeta bolla Aaroone sunth xaafa; issi issi zarkke kaaleththizaades issi guufey shiiqo. <verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Heytakka gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan efada ta nena haasayssizason Taabotazappe sinththa baggara woththa. <verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Hessafe guye tani doorizaade guufey purccidi cililana; hessan Isra7eele asay ubba wode ne bolla zuuzumontta mala ta diggana.»<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Hessa gishshas Musey hessa Isra7eele asaas yootides; dereza kaallizayti issoy issoy ba guufe guufe ekkidi izas immides; issi zarkke gishshas issi issi guufe gidishin ubbay issi bolla 12 guufey shiiqides; he shiiqida guufeta giddon Aaroone guufey dees. <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Musey guufeta ubbaa ekkidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon GODAA Caaqo Qaala Taabotaza sinththan woththides.<verse eid="NUM 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Wonteththa gallas Musey gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan gelishin Lewe qommo sunththan shiiqida Aaroone guufeya cililidaaro be7ides; qasseka ciiyada kaxxida ochcholoone ayfe ayfidaaro be7ides. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Museykka guufeta ubbaaka ekki efidi Isra7eele asaa bessides; asaykka hessa ubbaa be7idi issi issi korapinneti ba guufe guufe ekkida. <verse eid="NUM 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>GODAY Muses, «Aaroone guufeza zaarada Caaqo Qaala Taabotaappe sinththa baggara woththa; makkalliza Isra7eele asay ta bolla zuuzumizayssa aggontta ixxiko istti hayqqanayssa bessiza malata gidi utto» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:4">Ib 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Museykka GODAY iza azazida mala ooththides.<verse eid="NUM 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Isra7eele asay Muses, «Hayssa mala gidikko nuni wurikka wuranaas doos! <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezakko shiiqida asi ubbay hayqqizaa gidikko nunikka wuri hayqqanaas doos guussee?» gides.<verse eid="NUM 17:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Qeeseta Oosonne Lewe Ooso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>GODAY Aaroones, «Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon oosettiza mooro ubbaa gishshas neninne ne nayti, Lewe qommoti alaafeteth ekkideta; qeeseteththa ooson polettiza mooro gishshas gidikko hessa alaafeteth ekkanay nenanne ne nayta xalla. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>Neninne ne nayti Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan ooththiza wode inttena ooson maaddanaas Lewe qommo gidida ne baggata ekka. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>Istti ne alaafeteththa garsan dishe Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza ooso ooththetto; gido attiin geeshshasozan go7ettiza miishshatakko yarsho yarshizaso shiiqopetto; hee shiiqizaa gidikko neninne isttika issi bolla hayqqana. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>Istti ubba wode inttenara issife oosonne Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon isttas imettida ooso ubbaa ba alaafeteththan polanaas bessees; gido attiin Lewe qommo gidontta ay asikka ooththanaas intteko shiiqoppo.<verse eid="NUM 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>«Ta hanqoy qasseka Isra7eele asaa bolla qonccontta mala geeshshasozaninne yarsho yarshizasozan oosettiza oosoza alaafeteth polanayti inttenanne intte nayta xalla. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Intte bagga gidida Lewe zarkketa Isra7eele asaa garsafe inttes doorida imota histta immiday tana; isttika Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon baas imettida ooso ooththana mala taas dummatidayta. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Gido attiin yarsho yarshizasozaninne magalashaappe guye baggara ubbaafe dummatida giddo qol7aan oosettiza qeeseteththa oosoy neessinne ne naytas xalla bessees; qeeseteththa oosozakka ta inttes imota histta immadis; qeese gidontta ay asikka hee shiiqikko hayqqana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qeesetassinne Lewetas Imettiza Gisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Hayssafe guye GODAY Aaroones, «Xuugettontta coo mela taas shiiqiza yarsho ubbaa ta nees immidayssa yuushsha qoppa; hessika neessinne ne zare ubbaas gisha gidana mala tani immadis. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Taas daro dummati shiiqiza imotatappe taman xuugettontta yarshoy neessinne ne naytas gisha gidana; hessika kaththa yarsho ubbay, nagara gishshas woykko qoho gishshas shiiqiza yarsho ubbay neessinne ne naytas gisha gido. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Intte hessa geeshshasozan dishe miite; hessaka attumasay ubbay mo; izikka keehi dummatidaaza.<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>«Qasseka Isra7eele asay ta sinththan yaanne haa qaaseththi yarshiza yarshoy ubbay inttes gido; haytantta tani nees, ne macca naytas, ne attuma naytassinne sinththafe yaana yeleta ubbaas eqqi daana mala inttes gisha histta immadis; neso asaappe geesh gididay oonikka maanaas dandayees.<verse eid="NUM 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>«Isra7eele asay taas immiza oorath gakkiza kaththa xeerappe wogara zayte, woyne ushshinne kaththa qommo ubbaafe xeeraa ta inttes immadis. <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>Istti ba gadeppe taas GODAAS immiza kaththa xeeray inttessa; hessa intteso asaan geesh gidida asi oonikka maanaas dandayees.<verse eid="NUM 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>«Isra7eele asaappe taas imettida miishshi ubbay inttessa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:28">Lewe 27:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>Isra7eele asay taas shiishshiza meheppe woykko asappe bayra gidi yelettiday inttessa; gido attiin asaappe bayra gidi yelettidayssa gidikko istta miishshan wozzana bessees; hessaththoka geesh gidontta mehetappe koyro yelettidayssa miishshan wozzanaas dandayeeta. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Issi agina nayta wozzanaas geeshshasozan erettida meezaane likken ichchashu saqile bira wozzo miish ciggidi wozzanaas dandayeettes.<verse eid="NUM 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>«Miizappe woykko dorsafe woykko deyshafe bayra gidi yelettidayssa wozzofte; heyti mulekka geesh gidida gishshas taas yarsho gidi shiiqanaas bessees; istta suuththa yarsho yarshizasoza bolla aracite;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Aracite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aracite gizayssa issi issi bagga gamoththo qaalan pistto geetettees.</char></note> handazakka tana lo7o sawo sawana mala taman xuuggite. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Yaanne haa qaaseththi shiishshiza yarsho gididi shiiqiza angaso malanne ushachcha misse mala istta ashozi nees gido. <verse eid="NUM 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>Isra7eele asay taas shiishshiza dumma dumma imotata wursaka ta inttes, intte attuma naytassinne intte macca naytas buro sinththafe yaana wodetan ubbaan woga gididi inttes gisha gidana mala ta inttes immadis; hessika tani inttenaranne intte zereththatara caaqettiza laamettontta maxine caaqo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Maxine caaqo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maxine caaqoy Isra7eele biittan diza laamettontta caaqotappe issaa gidishin nu qaalan suuththa caaqo gizayssa mala woykko mernaas laamettontta caaqo mala.</char></note> mala» gides.<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>GODAY Aaroones, «Neni ne zereththas laatissanaas laata gadey nees imettenna; istta giddon nena gakkiza gishay aykkoyka deenna; nena gakkiza laatay tana Xoossaa» gides.<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>GODAY, «Isra7eele asay taas ehiza asraatay wuri Lewe zarkketas gisha gido gaada ta immadis; hessika istti Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon ooththiza oosoza damoza gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30-33">Lewe 27:30-33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22-29">Zaare 14:22-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Hankko Isra7eele asay gidikko ba bolla hayqo qixaate gaththontta mala nam7anththo gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezakko shiiqanaas bessenna. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Hayssafe guye Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon alaafeteth ekki ooththanaas bessizay Lewe zarkketa xalla gidana; heen oosettiza mooroska istti oyshettana; hessika isttas naa naa gakkanaas laamettontta woga gidana; Lewetas xinxxoy<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Xinxxo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Xinxxo guussi buzo gade guussa.</char></note> Isra7eele deren deenna. <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>Isra7eele asay taas dumma yarsho ehiza asraataa tani isttas gisha histta immadis; hessa gishshas isttas Isra7eele asaa giddon xinxxoy dontta mala yootadis» gides.<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Leweta Asraata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>«Neni Lewetas, ‹GODAY inttes gisha histti immiza asraata intte Isra7eele asaa kusheppe ekkishe intteka intte baggara he intte ekkidayssafe asraata kessidi GODAAS dumma yarsho histti shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Hessi he dumma yarshozi issi goshshanchchay kaththa xeera woykko woyne ushshu asraata immiza mala gidi inttes qoodettana. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Hessa malan intteka Isra7eele asaappe ekkiza asraata ubbaafe GODAAS dumma yarsho histti shiishshite; intte GODAAS shiishshiza yarshoza qeese Aaroones immite. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Intte ha ekkiza miish ubbaafe doorettidayssanne lo7o gididayssa GODAAS gisha histti immite.<verse eid="NUM 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>« ‹Goshshanchchay kaththa ayfeppenne woyne ushshafe doorettidayssa taas immidi attidayssa baas ekkiza mala intteka doorettidayssa taas immidi attidayssa inttes ekkite. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Hessika intte Gaytoteththa Dunkaane giddon ooththiza oosozas waaga gidida gishshas attidayssa intte intteso asaara awanka diidi maanaas dandayeeta. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Doorettidaaz intte GODAAS shiishshidaappe guye attidayssa intte miikko inttes nagara gidenna; gido attiin doorettidayssa izappe shaakkontta miidi dumma gidida Isra7eele asaa imota tunisontta mala naagettite; tunisizaa gidikko intte hayqqana› ga» gides.<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Geesho Haaththe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>GODAY Musessinne Aaroones hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>«Hayssi ta azazidayssi wogaas diza maara; Isra7eele asay izi morge bolla qambaray wodhdhi erontta borey baynda issi zo7o miiza us Isra7eele asay ehana mala asaas yoota. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>He ussayo qeese El7ezeeres immite; he ussayo asi dizasoppe gede kare kessiko heen iza sinththan shukettu. <verse eid="NUM 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>Qeese El7ezeerey izi suuththafe guuththara ekkidi ba biradhdhe xeeran laappunto gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezas sinththa baggara pistto. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>He ussay galbay, ashoy, suuththinne qanththa ashoy wuri qeeseza sinththan xuugetto. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Qeesezi Libaanoose ziga, hisophphenne zo7o qacina ekkidi ussaya xuugettiza tamazan yeggo. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Hessafe guye ba may7o meecco; ba bollaka haaththen meecettidi kase ba dizaso simmo; gido attiin omars gakkanaas wogay giza mala tuna gidi gam7o. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>He ussayo xuuggidaadeyka ba may7o meecco; ba bollaka haaththan meecetto; izikka omars gakkanaas tuna gidi gam7o.<verse eid="NUM 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>«Hessafe guye geesh gidida hara asi he bidinththaa shiishshi efidi asay dizasoppe gede kessidi geeshshasohon woththo; heenkka Isra7eele asay meecettidi geeyanaas go7iza haath giigsanaassa; hayssi wogazi oosettizay asa nagara wursanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:13">Ib 9:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Bidinththaa shiishshidaadey ba may7o meecco; gido attiin izi omarsa wode gakkanaas tuna gidi gam7o; hayssi wogazi Isra7eele asaassinne bete yiidi istta giddon diza asaas buroppe yaana yeleta ubbaas laamettontta woga gidana.<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aha Bosho Gishshas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>«Hayqqida asa aha bochchida asi laappun gallas gakkanaas tuna gidi gam7o. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Heedzdzanththo gallassaninne laappunththa gallassan geeyanaas giigetti diza haaththan bana geeshsho; hessafe guye izi geesh gidana; heedzdzanththo gallassinne laappunththa gallas bana geeshshontta aggiko izi geeyanaas dandayenna. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>Geeshshanaas diza haaththi iza bolla gukkontta aggida gishshas aha bochchidi bana geeshshontta asi tunida mala gam7o; hessa mala asi Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza tunisees; hessa gishshas izi Isra7eele asaa giddofe shaaketti kichcho.<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>«Issaadey Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon hayqqiko polettana wogay hayssa. Izi hayqqida wode he wode heen Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon dizaadey woykko hee gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezan gelizaadey laappun gallas gakkanaas tuna gidi gam7o. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>He Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza giddon tuchchi baynda diza otoy wurikka xaaroykka tuna gido. <verse eid="NUM 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>Asi wodhida asa aha gidiin woykko hargi hayqqida asa aha gidiin Karen kundi diza aha bochchidaadey woykko asa meqeth bochchidaadey laappun gallas gakkanaas tuna gido.<verse eid="NUM 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>«Tunida as nagarappe geeshshanaas xuugettiza ussay bidinththafe guuththara oton yegetto; xilli uttida pultto haaththi iza bolla gujjetto. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Kaallidi geesh gidida hara asi hisophphe miththa hagga ekkidi haaththan gelththi gelththi kessidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza bolla, iza giddon diza miishshata bollanne asaa bolla araco; hessafe guye asa meqeth woykko aha duufo bochchidaade bolla haaththe araco. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Heedzdzanththa gallassinne laappunththa gallas geeyidaadey hankko geeyonttaade bolla haaththe araco; laappunththa gallas iza geeshsho; he geeyzaadeyka ba may7o meeccidaappenne ba bolla meecettidaappe guye arshey wullishin izaadey geesh gidana.<verse eid="NUM 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>«Tunidaadeynne bana geeshshonttaadey geesho haaththaa ba bolla gussontta aggida gishshas izi tunida mala gam7o; hessa mala asi geeshshasoza tunisiza gishshas maabaraa giddofe shaaketti kichcho. <verse eid="NUM 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>Hayssa ha wogaa buroppe yaana yeletaas intte naaganaas bessees; geeshos go7iza haaththaa ba bolla araciza asi ba may7ozakka meeccanaas bessees; he haaththaa bochchidaadey omars gakkanaas tuna gidi gam7o. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Geeyontta asi bochchida miishshi ubbay tuna gido; he tuna miishshaa bochchida asikka omars gakkanaas tuna gido.»<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Zaallafe Pulttida Haath</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kessa 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Koyro aginan Isra7eele asay kumeth Xiine bazzon Qaadeese geetettizason dunkaani uttides; Maarama hayqqiin heen moogida. <verse eid="NUM 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>Asay dunkaani uttidasohon haaththi baynda gishshas Muse bollanne Aaroone bolla dendides. <verse eid="NUM 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>Derezi, «Nuni kase Gaytoteththa Dunkaane sinththan hayqqida Isra7eele asaa mala isttaththo nunikka hayqqidaakko nuus lo7o gidanashin; <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>intte GODAA maabaraa hayssa ha bazzo biitta ehiday nuninne nu mehey hayssan wurana mala ooththanaassee? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Intte nuna Gibxeppe kessidi hayssa aykkoy mokkontta iita bazzo nuna aazas ehidetii? Hayssan kaththi, balasey, woyne ayfeynne oroomaaney deenna; haray attoshin ganxi ekkiza haaththika deenna!» giidi Musera ooyettida. <verse eid="NUM 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Museynne Aarooney asaappe shaakettidi gede Gaytoteththa Dunkaane penge bida; istti duge biittan gufanni dishin GODAA bonchchoy isttas qonccides.<verse eid="NUM 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>«Caaqo Qaala Taabotaa sinththan diza guufeza ekkida neninne Aarooney kumeththa maabara issi bolla shiishshite; neni heen kumeththa deraa sinththan diza zaallazi haaththe immana mala yoota; neni hessaththo ooththada zaallazappe isttas haaththe kessa; histtiko isttinne istta mehey haath uyidi alana.»<verse eid="NUM 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Musey GODAY iza azazida mala biidi Gaytoteththa Dunkaanezappe ba guufeza ekki yides. <verse eid="NUM 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>Izinne Aarooney kumeththa maabaraa zaallaza sinththan shiishshidaappe guye Musey dereza, «Intteno makkallanchchatoo! Hayssa ha zaallazappe nu inttes haaththe kessanee!» gides. <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Hessafe guye Musey ba guufezan zaallaza nam7aa zaari shocides; wolqqama haaththi zaallafe pulttides; derezinne mehey haaththaa uyides.<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Gido attiin GODAY Muse bollanne Aaroone bolla, «Intte Isra7eele asa sinththan ta dummateththaa mala tana bonchchanaas ammanettibeekketa; hessa gishshas ta inttena laatissana ga caaqqida dereza hayssa deraa kaaleththidi gelekketa» gi hanqettides.<verse eid="NUM 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Isra7eele asay GODAARA ooyettidasoynne izi ba dummateththaa qonccisidasoy Mariiba geetettida gishshas haaththayka Mariiba haath geetetti summides.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Eedoome Asaanne Isra7eele Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Musey Eedoome kawos kiita gaththana mala qasttanne as Qaadeeseppe yeddides; «Ne isha Isra7eeley, ‹Nu bolla gakkida metoza ubbaa neni siyadasa; <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>Beni nu aawati waani duge Gibxe wodhdhidaakkonne nunikka Gibxen daro layththata waani waani didaakko ne eraasa; Gibxe asay kase nu aawata gidiin nunakka daro waayisides. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Nunikka izi nuna maaddana mala GODAAKKO waassidos; izikka nu waasoza siyidi Gibxeppe nuna kessanaas ba kiitanchcha nuus kiittides; hekko nuni ha7i nees dhassan diza Qaadeesen doos. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>Hessa gishshas nuni ne biittaara aadhdhi baana mala nuus ero garkkii! Nuna gidiin nu meheykka ogeppe kare kezokko; kaththa giddo gidiin woykko woyne miththa giddo nu gelokko; ne haaththa ollafekka uyokko; ne dereppe aadhdhana gakkanaas ogeppe kare kezokko› gees» gi kiittides.<verse eid="NUM 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Eedoome asay gidikko, «Intte nu derera aadhdhi baana mala koyokko; intte nu dere gelanaas paacciko nu intte bolla worajjana» gida.<verse eid="NUM 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Isra7eele asaykka, «Nuni waanna ogezappe kezokko; nuna gidiin woykko nu mehey intte haaththafe uyikko nu inttes iza waaga qanxxana; nu waanna koyzay intte derezara aadhdhi baanaassa» giidi isttas malthe immida.<verse eid="NUM 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>Eedoome asay gidikko, «Hessi hanenna! Nu inttena aaththi yeddoko!» giidi mino olanchchata ekkidi Isra7eele asaa olanaas kezida. <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>Eedoome dere asay ba biittara aaththi yeddonttayssa eridi Isra7eele asay ba biza ogeza laammidi harasora bides.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aaroone Hayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Kumeththa Isra7eele maabaray Qaadeeseppe dendi Hoore zumaakko gakkides. <verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>He zumazi Eedoome dhassan dees; GODAY heen Musessinne Aaroones, <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>«Tani Isra7eele asaas immana gaada kase caaqqida dereyo Aarooney gelenna; intte wurikka Mariiba haaththaa achchan ta azazoza bolla makkallida gishshas Aarooney hayqqana. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Aaroonenne iza naaza El7ezeere nenara ekkada pude Hoore zumaa bolla keza. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>Aarooney qeeseteththas may7ida may7oza qaara ekkada El7ezeere mayza; Aarooney heen hayqqana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Museykka GODAY izas gidayssa ubbaaka ooththides; kumeththa maabaray istta xeellishin istti pude Hoore zumaa bolla kezida. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Museykka Aaroone qeeseteththa may7oza qaari ekkidi El7ezeere mayzides; Aarooney heen zumaa hu7en hayqqides; Museynne El7ezeerey zumaa bollafe duge simmi wodhdhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:29">Kessa 29:29</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 33:38">Tay 33:38</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:6">Zaare 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Aarooney hayqqidayssa kumeththa derezi siyidi 30 gallas gakkanaas izas mishettidi yeekkides.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Kanaane Asaa Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Izas duussasoy Negebe gidida Kanaane dere kawo Araadey Isra7eele asay Ataraame baggara yizayssa siyidi istta bolla ola denththidi isttafe amardayta di7ides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:40">Tay 33:40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>He wode Isra7eele asay, «Nuni hayssa dereza xoonana mala ne nuna maaddiko istta gidiin woykko istta katamata nam7anththo dendontta mala ooththidi nu istta mulera dippi histtana» giidi GODAAS adinida. <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>GODAY istta woosa siyidi maaddida gishshas istti Kanaane asaa xooni oykkida; hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay isttanne istta katama mulera dippi histti dhayssida; istti wuri wuridayssa eranaas hessa he gadeza, «Horma» gi sunththida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Horma guussi Ibraaweta qaalara, «Gome woykko qanggeth woykko tuna miish» guussa.</char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xarqimalappe Oosettida Shoosh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Isra7eele asay Eedoome dere yuuyi aadhdhidi baanaas qoppida Hoore zumaappe dendidi gede Zo7o abbaako efiza ogezara bida; gido attiin istti buro ogen dishin derezappe dandayay wurides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:1">Zaare 2:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>GODAA bollanne Muse bolla iita qaala kessidi, «Haaththinne kaththi bayndaso hayssa bazzo biittan nu hayqqana mala nuna Gibxeppe ays kessidetii? Hayssi ha iita kaththay nuna saleththides» gida. <verse eid="NUM 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Hessafe guye GODAY iita marzera diza shoosh dereza giddo yeddides; he shooshshay dukkiin Isra7eele asaappe daroy hayqqides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:9">1Qoro 10:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Derezikka Musekko biidi, «GODAA bollanne ne bolla nu iita qaala haasayda gishshas nuni qohidos; ha7ikka hayti dukkiza shooshshati nuuppe kichchana mala neni nuus GODAA woossarkkii!» gida; Museykka deraas woossides. <verse eid="NUM 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>He wode GODAY Muses, «Neni xarqimala shoosh qoxxa kessada tuussa mala adussa miththa bolla kaqqa; shooshshi dukkida asi wurikka hessa be7idi attana» gides. <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Museykka xarqimalappe shoosh medhdhidi tuussa mala adussa miththa bolla qaaphides; shooshshi saxxida asi ubbay he xarqimala shooshshaa dhoqqu gi xeelliday xeelliday paxides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">2Kawo 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoha 3:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Uureppe Dendidi Mo7aabe Buus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Isra7eele asay ba dizasoppe dendi biidi Obooten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>Heeppe dendidi Mo7aabeppe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Iye-Abaarime bazzon dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>Heeppe dendi biidi Zaraade shoobban uttides. <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>Heeppeka dendi biidi Amooreta derera kanththi biza bazzo Arnoone shaafappe he pinththan diza biittan dunkaani uttida; Arnoone shaafazi Mo7aabe deresinne Amoore derezas giddo dhassan dees. <verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Hessa gaason GODAY kaaleththiin olettida ola gishshas yootiza taarike maxaafazan, «Suufa heeraninne shoobbatan diza Waheebe kataman Arnoonen haaththi baynda shaafan, <verse eid="NUM 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>biidi Eere katamanne Mo7aabe dhas gakkanaas kanththi biza zoozeta» geetettides. <verse eid="NUM 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>Heeppe dendidi Bi7eere bida; hessika GODAY Muses, «Deraa issi bolla shiishsha; tani isttas haath immana» giidi yootida haaththa olla.<verse eid="NUM 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>He wode Isra7eele asay hayssa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">«Haysso pulttozo pultta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:17">intteka izas yexxite.<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>Kawoti ba kawoteththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">guufen bookkida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">daannati ba guufen ziqqisida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:18">haaththa ollaas yexxite» gida.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 21:18">He bazzozappe dendidi gede Mataane bida. <verse eid="NUM 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>Mataaneppeka gede Nahal7eelera kanththidi gede Bamoote bida. <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>Bamooteppe dendidi Amoone deren diza shoobbaa bida; he shoobbayka Pizga zumaappe dan7e baggara bazzoza ginan dees.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawo Sihoone Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Zaare 2:26—3:11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay Amoore dere kawo Sihoones qasttanne yeddidi, <verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>«Nuni ne biittara aadhdhi baana mala nuna aaththa yeddarkkii! Nuninne nu mehey ogeppe kare kezokko; gede ne kaththa giddo gidiin woykko ne woyne miththa gars nu gelokko; ne haaththa ollafe ekki uyokko; nuni ne derera aadhdhi baana gakkanaas ogeppe sher7i gookko» gides.<verse eid="NUM 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Sihooney gidikko Isra7eele asay iza biittara aadhdhi baana mala koyibeenna; harappeka izi baas diza ola asaa shiishshi ekkidi Yahaaxe bazzo wodhdhides; Isra7eele asaraakka ola oykettides. <verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Isra7eele asay gidikko istta xoonides; Arnoone shaafappe doommidi Amoone dere dhas gidida Yaabooqe shaafa gakkanaas dizasoza oykkida; gido attiin Amoone asay ba zawa minni naagiza gishshas hee gelibeettenna. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Isra7eele asay histtidi Amoore dere biittan diza katamata Haseboonenne he heeran diza guuththa katamatakka oykkidi dunkaani uttida. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Hasebooney Amooreta kawo Sihooney kawotida katama; izikka kase Mo7aaben kawotida kawozara olettidi Arnoone shaafaa gakkanaas diza biitta ubbaa isttafe woththi ekkides. <verse eid="NUM 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Ginxo giigsidi yexxizayti hessa gishshas yexxishe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">«Haseboonekko haa yiite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">Hanna katamaya gimbettu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">Sihoone katamaya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">ooso doomettu.<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>Hasebooneppe tamay kezides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Lacoykka Sihoone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">katamappe kezides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Mo7aabe deren</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Eere geetettizasoza dhayssides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">Arnoonen bolla gezze biittan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">halaqatakka dippi histtides.<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Hanne Mo7aabe nees aayye ana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Intteno Kamooshes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">goynnizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Intte dippi gi dhayana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">intte attuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">nayta betes,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">intte macca naytakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">di7eteththas Amoore kawo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Sihoones aaththi immides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:45-46">Er 48:45-46</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Hessa gishshas istta zereththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">mulera dhaydes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Hasebooneppe biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Diboone gakkanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Nofappe biidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">Medeba gakkanaas diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">ubbaa piski histti laallidos» gida.<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay Amoore deren dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Museykka Iyaazeere biidi xomosana as yeddides; Isra7eele asaykka he katamayonne izi heeran diza qeeri katamata oli oykkida; kase heen diza Amoore asata gooddida.<verse eid="NUM 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawo Aage Xooneteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay guye simmidi gede Baasaane efiza ogezara bida; Baasaane kawo Aagey Edira7en isttara ola oykettanaas ba olanchchata ubbaa ekki kezides. <verse eid="NUM 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>GODAY Muses, «Hayssa addezas babbofa! Iza asaanne iza dereza ta nees aaththa immana; kase Haseboonen de7ishe Amooreta haariza kawo Sihoone bolla ne ooththoyssaththo hayssa bollaka ooththa» gides. <verse eid="NUM 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele asay Aage, iza naytanne iza deraa ubbaa dippi histtidi biitta baas ekkides.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Balaaqenne Balaame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Hessafe guye Isra7eele asay dendidi Iyarkko ginara Yordaanoose shaafappe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Mo7aabe demban dunkaani uttides.<verse eid="NUM 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Isra7eele asay Amooreta bolla ooththidayssa ubbaa Xipoora naa Balaaqey siyides. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/>Isra7eele asay keehi daro gidida gishshas Mo7aabe asay keehippe babbides. <verse eid="NUM 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Mo7aabeti Midiyaame cimatas, «Booray maata mi dhayssiza mala ha maate asay nu yuushon diza ubbaa dippi histti dhayssana» gida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:4">He wode Mo7aabe Kawo Xipoora naa Balaaqey, <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>Amaawa biittan Efiraaxise shaafa matan Patoore katamaan diza Bi7oore naa Balaamekko qasttanne kiittidi, «Beya! Gibxe biittafe kezida issi derey biittaa may7ides; he derezi nu matan dunkaani uttides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8">Tay 31:8</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:15-16">2Phex 2:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:11">Yuhu 11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/>Istti nuuppe keehi wolqqama gidida gishshas woze nena huu! Haa yaada taas istta qanggarkkii! Ne qanggizaa gidikko ta istta xoonada biittafe kessanakko oonee erizay? Ays giikko neni anjjidaadey anjjettizayssa, ne qanggidaadey qanggettizayssa ta erays» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Histtiin Mo7aabe cimatinne Midiyaame cimati qanggisanaas ekki bida miishsha Balaames immidi Baalaaqe kiitaa yootida. <verse eid="NUM 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>Balaamey isttas, «Intte hach haan aqikko GODAY taas yootidayssa ubbaa ta inttes wonto maalado yootana» gides; histtiin Mo7aabe cimati Balaame matan aqida.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Xoossi Balaamekko yiidi, «Hayti nenara diza asati ay asee?» giidi oychchides.<verse eid="NUM 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Balaameykka Xoossas, «Mo7aabe kawo Xipoora naa Balaaqey, <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>‹Gibxeppe kezida derey biittaa yi may7ides; neni yaada taas istta qanggizaa gidikko ta istta ola xoonada biittafe kessanakko oonee erizay!› gi kiittida asata» gi zaarides.<verse eid="NUM 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Xoossi qasse Balaame, «Neni hayta ha asatara booppa; Isra7eele derey anjjettida dere gidida gishshas neni istta qanggofa» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Wonteththa gallas maaladora Balaamey dendidi Balaaqey kiittida cimatas, «Tani inttenara bontta mala GODAY diggida gishshas intte biitta simmite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Histtiin Mo7aabe cimati Balaaqekko simmidi Balaamey isttara yontta ixxidayssa izas yootida.<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Hessafe guye zaaridikka Balaaqey kase kiitettidaytappe aadhdhi bonchchettidanne qoodan daro cimata Balaamekko kiittides. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>Isttika Balaamekko biidi, «Xipoora naa Balaaqey nena, ‹Neni taakko yontta mala ay miishshika nena teqqofo! <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Ta nees iza kushe zaarana; ne tana oychchida ubbaa ta nees immana; hessa gishshas ha dereza yaada ne taas qanggana mala ta nena shoobbays!› gides» gi yootida.<verse eid="NUM 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Gido attiin Balaamey isttas, «Balaaqey ba kawoteththa keeththan diza biranne worqqa ubbaa izi taas immizaakkoka GODAY tana azazida azazoza menththada tani taappe ay miishshika gujjanaas woykko pacinchchanaas dandaykke. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>GODAY taas yootiza hara miishshi diikko ta eranaashe gakkanaas intteka kaseytaththo hachcha omars haan aqite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>He gallassa omars Xoossi Balaamekko yiidi, «Ha asati nena xeygana yida gishshas dendada isttara ba; gidikkoka ta nees yootizaaz xalla ooththa» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaamenne Iza Hareyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Histtiin wonteththa gallas Balaamey ba hare koori toggi ekkidi Mo7aabe halaqatara bides. <verse eid="NUM 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Balaamey ba hare toggi ekkidinne ba aylletappe nam7ata kaaleththidi bishin GODAA hanqoy iza bolla tama mala eexxi kezides; histtiin GODAA kiitanchchay iza teqqanaas oge bolla aadhdhi eqqides. <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Hareya GODAA kiitanchchay giththa mashsha oykkidi eqqidayssa beyada ogeppe haraso kezadus. Balaamey hareyo ogen zaaranaas iita shoch shocides.<verse eid="NUM 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Histtiin GODAA kiitanchchay nam7u baggara woyney tokettizasohoppe giddon ya baggaranne ha baggara gimbey gimbetti uttida un7oson eqqides. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Hareya GODAA kiitanchchaza be7ida mala gimbezaakko shiiqada Balaame tohoza gimbezara daraxadus; histtiin Balaamey hareyo nam7anththo buka oykkides.<verse eid="NUM 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Hessafe guye GODAA kiitanchchay gede sinththe aadhdhi biidi nam7u baggara aadhdhizasoy baynda xunththa ogen eqqides. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Hareya GODAA kiitanchchaza be7ada Balaamey toggi dishin biittan ichchadus; hessa gishshas Balaamey ba guufera izo bukkides. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>He wode GODAY hareys haasayanaas doona doyiin iza Balaames, «Ta nees ay iita ooththadinaa? Heedzdzuto ne tana ays shocadii?» gadus.<verse eid="NUM 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Balaameykka izis, «Ne tana keeha kaa7ida gishshassa! Ta kushen mashshay dizaakko ta nena wodho wodhanashin!» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Hareyakka Balaames, «Hanno gakkanaas ne toggiza ta ne hareyo gidikkinaa! Hayssafe kase hanniththo hana erazinaa?» gadus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Balaamey izis zaaridi, «Mulekka hayssaththo hana erakka» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>He wode GODAY Balaame ayfeta doyiin GODAA kiitanchchay giththa mashsha shoddi oykkidi ogen eqqidayssa be7idi Balaamey biitta bolla gufannides. <verse eid="NUM 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>GODAA kiitanchchazi izas, «Ne hareyo ays heedzdzuto shocadii? Tani yaada ne oge gordiday ne biza ogezi geella gidida gishshas nena zaaranaassa. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Ne hareya tana be7ada heedzdzuto ta sinththafe baqatadus; iza baqatonttaako ta izo aggada nena wodhaychchanakkoshin» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Balaamey GODAA kiitanchchaas zaaridi, «Tumukka ta nagara ooththadis; ne tana teqqanaas oge bolla eqqidayssa ta erabeekke; ha7ikka ne ta buussaa dosonttaa gidikko tani guye taso simmana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>GODAA kiitanchchay Balaames, «Ne ha asatara ba shin tani nees yootizayssa xalla yoota» gides; histtiin Balaamey Balaaqey kiittida halaqatara bides.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaaqey Balaame Moko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Balaaqey Balaamey yizayssa siyidi iza mokkanaas Mo7aabe bazzon Arnoone shaafa achchan diza Eere katama bides. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Balaaqey Balaame, «Koyro ta neekko kiittida asatara aazas yontta ixxadii? Ta nena bonchchontta as misatiinee?» gi iza oychchides.<verse eid="NUM 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Balaameykka Balaaqes, «Gidikkoka ha7i tani neekko yadis; ha7ikka taas ay wolqqay dizee? Ta haasayana dandayzay Xoossi taas yootooro xalla» gides. <verse eid="NUM 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Hessa gishshas Balaamey Balaaqera gede Qiriyaate Huxoote katama bides. <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>Balaaqey heen mehe shukissidi he ashozappe guuth heen banara diza dere kaaleththizaytassinne Balaames immides. <verse eid="NUM 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Wonteththa gallas maalado Balaaqey Balaame Isra7eele asaappe baggay beettizaso pude Bamooti Ba7aale geetettiza zumaa bolla kessides.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Balaamey Yootida Koyro Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Balaamey Baalaaqe, «Ne taas hayssan laappun yarsho yarshanaasota ooththa; qasseka laappun korma booratanne laappun dorsa dharshota taas haa ekka ya» gides. <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Balaaqey Balaamey izas yootida mala ooththides; istti nam7ay yarsho yarshizasohota bolla issi issi korma booranne issi issi dharsho yarsho shiishshida. <verse eid="NUM 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Hessafe guye Balaamey Balaaqes, «Xoossi haa taakko Yaanaakkonne yonttaakko tani gede baada erana gakkanaas neni hayssan xuugettiza yarshoza achchan eqqaashsha; GODAY taas qonccisikko hessa ta nees wursa yootana» gides; hessafe guye Balaamey barkka pude dhoqqaso kezides. <verse eid="NUM 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Heen Xoossi izara gayttides; Balaameykka, «Tani laappun yarsho yarshizasohota giigsadis; yarsho yarshizasohota issaa issaa bolla issi issi korma booranne issi issi dharsho yarshadis» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>GODAYKKA Balaamey Balaaqes yootanaas bessiza kiita izas yootidaappe guye Balaaqekko simmi baana mala yootides. <verse eid="NUM 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>Izikka guye simmi bishin Balaaqey Mo7aabe ayssiza daannata ubbaara issife he xuugettiza yarshoza achchan eqqida mala demmides. <verse eid="NUM 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Hessafe guye Balaamey haasaya doommidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">«Mo7aabe kawo Balaaqey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">arshey mokkiza baggara diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">zumati diza Aaraameppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">tana xeygi ehides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">izi tana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">‹Haa yaada Isra7eele asaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">taas doqqarkkii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">Istti dhayana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">taas istta qanggarkkii!› gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>Histtiin tani Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">qanggonttaade wostta qanggoo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">Xoossi hilonttaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">tani wostta hiloo?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>Tani istta hayta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">gita zaallata bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">dashe demmays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">dhoqqa zumata bolla dashe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">ta istta xeellays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">istti barkka diza kawoteth;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">istti bana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">hara kawoteththara gaththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">qoodonttayssi taas beettees.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Gudulla mala corida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">Yaaqoobe zereththaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">qoodi dandayanay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">Woykko Isra7eeles cigozakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">qoodi kanththanay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">Xillo asata hayqo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">ta hayqqana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">ta wurseththayka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">istta wurseththaa mala gido» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Balaaqey Balaames, «Hayssi ne ta bolla ooththidayssi aazee? Tani nena haa ehiday ne ta morkketa qangganaassa; neni gidikko istta anjjo anjjadasa attiin qanggabeekka» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>Balaameykka zaaridi, «GODAY taas qonccisidayssa xalla ta yootanaas bessennee?» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaamey Yootida Nam7anththo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Balaaqey Balaames, «Isra7eele asaa kumeththaa gidontta isttafe guuththati nees beettizaso gede haraso tanara issife baada ne istta heen taas qanggarkkii!» gides. <verse eid="NUM 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>Hessafekka pude Pizga zumaa hu7en diza Xoofime demba efides; heenkka laappun yarsho yarshizaso giigsidi issi issi yarshizasoza bolla issi issi korma booranne dharsho yarshides.<verse eid="NUM 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Balaamey Balaaqes, «Neni hayssa xuugettiza yarshoza matan eqqaashsha; tani GODAARA gayttana gede bays» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>GODAYKKA Balaamera heen gayttides; izi yootana kiitaa izas yootidi neni Balaaqekko simma baada hayssa ha kiitaa izas yoota. <verse eid="NUM 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>Izi simmi bishin Balaaqey Mo7aabe dereza kaaleththizaytara he xuugettiza yarshoza matan eqqida mala demmides; Balaaqeyka GODAY izas ay yootidaakko iza oychchides.<verse eid="NUM 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Balaameykka izas haasaya doommishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">«Xipoora naa Baalaaqe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">Haa shiiqa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">Tani nees yootizayssa siya.<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>Xoossi asa mala wordotenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">iza qofay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">asa qofa mala laamettenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">izi ba immida hidota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">ubbaa polees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">izi ba yootida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">ubbaa ooththees.<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>Izi taas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">ta anjjana mala yootides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">Xoossi anjjida qaalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">tani laammanaas dandaykke.<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>Yaaqoobe zereththa bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">metoy gakkenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">Isra7eele asaa bollaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">waayey gakkonttayssi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">taas beettees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">GODAY isttara dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">Xoossi kawo gididayssa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">istti qonccen yooteettes.<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>Xoossi istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">Gibxeppe kessides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">izi isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">menththa mala qaycana.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>Yaaqoobe nayta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">ay bitay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">Isra7eele bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">ay muurennoyka ooththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">hekko ha7i Yaaqoobessinne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">Isra7eeles,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">‹Xoossi istti ay ooththidaakko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">ane xeellite!› geetettana.<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Isra7eele asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">macca gaammo mala dendana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">ba shankkati ehidayssa montta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">suuththaaka uyontta dishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">shempontta gaammo mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">dendana» gi yootides.<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Hessafe guye Balaaqey Balaames, «Neni Isra7eele asaa qanggontta ixxida mala istta anjjoka anjjofa!» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Balaameykka, «Tani kase nees GODAY taas yootooro xalla ta ooththana gaada yootabeekkinaa?» gides.<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaamey Yootida Heedzdzanththo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Balaaqeyka, «Haa ya ane hayssafe haraso boos; oonee erizay neni heen daada hayssa dereza taas qanggana mala Xoossi nees ero gontta aggenna» gides. <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Hessa gishshas Balaaqey Balaame gede bazzo ginara diza Pe7oore zumaa hu7e ekki kezides. <verse eid="NUM 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Balaameykka iza, «Hayssan taas laappun yarsho yarshizaso giigsa; laappun korma booratanne laappun dharshota haa taas ekka ya» gides. <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Balaaqeyka Balaamey izas yootida mala ooththides; yarsho yarshizasoza bolla issi issi korma booranne issi issi dharsho yarsho shiishshides.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Balaameykka GODAY Isra7eele asaa anjjanaas dosidayssa erida wode kase izi ooththizayssa mala muurenno ooso ooththanaas koyibeenna; ba sinththaaka duge bazzo zaarides. <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>Isra7eele asay ba qommon qommon maarara dunkaani uttidayssa be7ides; Xoossa Ayanay iza bolla wodhdhides; <verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>histtiin izi tinbite haasaya doommidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">«Bi7oore naa Balaamey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">haasayza tinbite qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">iza ayfetikka doyettidaadey,<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>Xoossa qaala siyizaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">izi kundi dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">iza ayfeti doyettiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossa ajjuuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">be7izaade kiitay hayssa.<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>Yaaqoobe ne dunkaaneti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">Isra7eele ne dizasoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">ay mala lo7oo?<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>Isttika micettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">zulleta mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">qasseka shaafa doonan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">atakiltesohota mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">GODAY tokkida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">godare uuththa mala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">woykko shaafa doonan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">Libaanoose ziga mala.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>Iray ubba wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">isttas bukkiza gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">istta haaththi kumi palahees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">zereththa wode isttas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">gidiza haaththi dees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">istta kawoy Agaageppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">aadheth gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">istta kawoteththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>Istta Gibxeppe kessida Xoossi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">isttas menththa mala olettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">istta morkke gidida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">kawoteththata izi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">puuzereththi yeggana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">izi istta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">meqeththata liiqisana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">istta wondafetakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">menththereththi yeggana.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>Hayssi kawoteththay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">gaammo mala zamadi uttides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">macca gaammo malakka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">zuggi uttides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">istti zamadi uttidasohoppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">istta denththana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">dandayzay oonee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">Nena anjjizaadey anjjetto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">nena qanggizaadeyka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">qanggetto» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Medhe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:9">49:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Balaaqey hanqon ba kushe baqqidi Balaames, «Tani nena ta morkketa qangganaas xeygadis; gido attiin neni istta heedzdzuto anjjadasa. <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Ha7i gidikko eeson gede neso ba! Ta nees daro miish immana ga qaala geladis; gido attiin ne he miishshaa demmontta mala Xoossi gordides» gides.<verse eid="NUM 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Balaamey Balaaqes zaaridi, «Neni taakko kiittida asatas, <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>‹Balaaqey baas diza biranne worqqa ubbaa izi taas immizaakkoka tani ta shenen iita gidiin woykko lo7o ooththanaas GODAA qaalappe aadhdhanaas dandaykke; tani yootanay GODAY taas yootooro xalla› gaada kase ta isttas yootabeekkinaa?» gides.<verse eid="NUM 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Balaamey Yootida Oydanththo Tinbite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Wurseththan Balaamey Balaaqes, «Ha7i tani gede ta dere simma bays; gido attiin ta baanaappe kasetada Isra7eele asay ne dere asaa bolla gaththanayssa nees qonccisanaas koyays» gides. <verse eid="NUM 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Hessafe guye izas tinbite yooto doommidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">«Iza ayfey doyettidaadey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">Bi7oore naa Balaamey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">yootiza tinbite qaalay hayssa;<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>Xoossa qaala siyizaade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">izi kundi dishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">iza ayfeti doyettiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">Wolqqama Xoossafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">erateth demmidaade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">Ubbaa Dandayza Xoossaa ajjuuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">be7izaade kiitay hayssa.<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>Tani iza be7ays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">gido attiin ha7i gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">ta iza xeellays;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">gidikkoka ha7i matan gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Xoolinttey Yaaqoobeppe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">beettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Kawoteththa guufey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Isra7eeleppe kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Mo7aabe zereththaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">Seete zereththata ubbaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">dippi histti dhayssana.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>Eedoomey xoonettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">iza morkke Seyreykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">izas haarettana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:18">Isra7eele derey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">xoonoy xoonoshin daana.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Yaaqoobeppe dere ayssizaadey kezana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">izi katama giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">attidayta pitti dhayssana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurseththan Balaamey Haasayda Haasaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Hessafe guye Balaamey gede Amaaleeqe zaari xeellidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">«Amaaleeqey ubbaafe aadhdhiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">wolqqama kawoteth;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">gido attiin izi wurseththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">mernaas dhayana»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">gi tinbite yootides.<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>Gede Qenaawe dere asaakko simmi xeellidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">«Ne duussasoy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">ammanettidaso misatikkoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">Ne keeththay zaallafe woocetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">keexettidaa gidikkoka,<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Intteno Qenaawe deretoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">Asoorey inttena xoonidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">di7i efiza wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">intte wuri wurana» gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">tinbite yootides.<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>Wurseththan Balaamey,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:23">«Xoossi hayssa ooththishin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:23">oonee shemppora paxa daanay?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Olas worajjiza asay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">markabera Qophirooseppe yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">isttika Asoorenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">Eboore dhayssana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">isttika ba hu7es mernaas dhayana» gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">tinbite yootides.<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Hessafe guye Balaamey dendidi gede ba dere bides; Balaaqeyka baso simmides.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Mo7aabe Asaa Baleththo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Isra7eele asay Shiixime shoobban diza wode addeti heen diza Mo7aabe dere maccassatara laymatida; <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>He Mo7aabe maccassati eeqa xoossatas yarshiza yarsho kaththaafe maana mala Isra7eele asaa xeygiin isttika he kaththaafe miidi eeqa xoossas goynnida. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Isra7eele asay Ba7aali-Pe7oore geetettiza eeqa xoossaas goynnida gishshas Xoossi istta bolla hanqettides. <verse eid="NUM 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>GODAY Muses, «Isra7eele asaa bolla eexxida ta hanqoy dochchana mala Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizayta ubbaa ekkada seeta gallas suulliza awan derezi be7ishin kaqqa wodha» gides. <verse eid="NUM 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Museykka Isra7eele asaa bolla pirdiza daannatas, «Intte issoy issoy intte zarkkefe zarkkefe Ba7aali-Pe7oore geetettiza eeqa xoossazas goynnida as ubbaa wodhite» giidi azazides.<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Museynne kumeththa maabaray Gaytoteththa Dunkaane pengen shiiqidi yeekkishin Isra7eele asaa garsafe issaadey issi Midiyaame maccassayo ekkidi deraa sinththara aadhdhi gede baso asaakko bides. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Qeese Aaroones naaza nay, El7ezeere naa Finihaasi hessa be7idi kase ba uttidasohoppe pusukku gi dendidi tohora ekkidi dereza giddofe kezi bides. <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>He addezinne maccassaya izan diza dunkaanen gelides; nam7atakka issi bolla toorara caddi wodhides; histtiin Isra7eele asaa bolla yida boshay simmides. <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>Boshay simmana gakkanaas sinththan hayqqida asay 24,000 gidides.<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>«Qeese Aaroones naaza naa, El7ezeere naa Finihaasi Isra7eele asaa giddon tani ta bonchchos eqettiza mala izi eqettida gishshas istta bolla ta hanqettida hanqoy dochchides; hessa gishshas tani ta hanqozan Isra7eele asaa dhayssabeekke. <verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>Hessa gaason tani izas mernaa saroteththa caaqo qaala gelidayssa ne izas yoota. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Izi ba Godaa bonchchos eqqida gishshassinne deraa nagara izi wursida gishshas izinne iza zereththati ubbay mernaas qeese gidana.»<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>He Midiyaame maccassayra issife hayqqida Isra7eele addeza sunththi Saalu naa Zimire geetettees; izikka Simoona zarkketas korapinne. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>He maccassaya Kozeebo geetettawus; izi aaway Xuure geetettees; izikka banara issife diza amarda Midiyaame qommotas korapinne.<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>«Intte Midiyaame asaa morkke mala qoodidi dippi histti dhayssite. <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>Gaasoykka istti Pe7ooren intte bolla gene ooththida gishshassinne heen wodhdhida bosha geedon hayqqida istta halaqaa nayo Kozeebi baggara baleththidi intte bolla morkketeththa ooso ooththida gishshassa.»<verse eid="NUM 25:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asaas Nam7anththo Qoodeteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>He boshazi aggidaappe guye Xoossi Musessinne qeese Aaroone naa El7ezeeres, <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>«Kumeththa Isra7eele maabaran issaade keeththan keeththan isttas layththi 20 kumidaytanne hessafekka bollara gididi wottadareteththan ooththanaas dandayza attuma nayta ubbaa qoodite» gides. <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Museynne qeese El7ezeerey Yordaanoose shaafa matan Iyarkko ginara diza Mo7aabe dembaan dereza shiishshidi, <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>«GODAY Muses azazida mala nam7u tammu layththinne hessafekka bollara diza asaa ubbaa qoodite» gida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Gibxe dereppe kezida Isra7eele asay hayssafe kaallizayta; <verse eid="NUM 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Yaaqoobes bayra naaza Oroobeele zarkkefe yelettidayti Heenookenne iza zereththata, Paalunne iza zereththata,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:1-46">Tay 1:1-46</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>Hexiroomenne iza zereththata, Karmenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Oroobeele zarkkefe qoodettidayti 43,730. <verse eid="NUM 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Paalu nay Elyaabe; <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>Elyaabe nayti Namu7eele, Daataanenne Abraame; Daataaneynne Abraamey derezan doorettidayta gidi uttidi Qooreranne iza kaallizaytara zuppetidi GODAA bolla makkallidi Musenne Aaroone paaccida. <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Isttaka biittaya doyettada Qoorera issi bolla gaththa mittadus; isttika hayqqiin saloppe wodhdhida tamay 250 asaa xuuggides; histtiin istta qaxxayeteththi hara asaas malata gidides. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Qoore zereththati gidikko hayqqibeettenna.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Simoona zarkkefe yelettidayti Namu7eelenne iza zereththata, Yaaminenne iza zereththata, Yaakinenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>Zaraahenne iza zereththata, Sa7oolenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Simoona zarkketappe qoodettidayti 22,200 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Gaade zarkkefe yelettidayti Xifoonenne iza zereththata, Haggenne iza zereththata, Shuunenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>Osinanne iza zereththata, Eerenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>Aroodenne iza zereththata, Ar7eelenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Gaade zarkketappe qoodettidayti 40,500 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>Yuhuda zarkkefe yelettidayti, Eeranne Oonaane; istti Kanaane biittan hayqqida. <verse eid="NUM 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Hankko attida Yuhuda zarkkefe yelettidayti Seloomenne iza zereththata, Paareesenne iza zereththata, Zaraahenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Paareese zereththati Hexiroomenne iza baggata, Hamulenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Yuhuda zarkkefe qoodettidayti 76,500 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Yisakoore zarkkefe yelettidayti Tola iza zereththata, Puuwanne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>Yaashubenne iza zereththata, Shimiroonenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Yisakoore zarkketappe qoodettidayti 64,300 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Zaabiloone zarkkefe yelettidayti, Sereedenne iza zereththata, Eeloonenne iza zereththata, Yaahile7eelenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Zaabiloone zarkkefe qoodettidayti 60,500 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Yooseefe zarkkefe yelettidayti, Minaasenne iza zereththata, Efreemenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Minaase nayta zereth Maakirey Gala7aade yelides; <verse eid="NUM 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>Gala7aade nayti Eezerenne iza zereththata, Heleeqenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>Asira7eelenne iza zereththata, Seekeemenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>Shamidanne iza zereththata, Hefeerenne iza zereth. <verse eid="NUM 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Hefeere naa Xilofaadey macca nayta xalla yelides; heytikka Mahilo, No7o, Hogilo, Milkkonne Tirxxo geetetteettes. <verse eid="NUM 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Minaase qommotappe qoodettidayti 52,700 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Efreeme zarkkefe yelettidayti, Shutulanne iza zereththata, Bekerenne iza zereththata, Tahaanenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Shutula naa Eraanenne iza zereththata. <verse eid="NUM 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Efreeme zarkketappe qoodettidayti 32,500 addeta; Yooseefe zarkkefe ba baggan baggan qoodettidayti haytantta.<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Biniyaame zarkkefe yelettidayti, Beelanne iza zereththata, Ashibeelenne iza zereththata, Ahiraamenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>Shafaamenne iza zereththata, Hufumenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Beela zarkkefe Araadenne iza zereththata; Na7imaanenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Biniyaame zarkkefe qoodettidayti 45,600 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Daane zarkketappe yelettidayti, Shuhaamenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Shuhaame zereththata qooday 64,400 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Aaseere zarkketappe yelettidayti Yiminenne iza zereththata, Yishiwenne iza zereththata, Barihenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Barihe naytappe Heeberenne iza zereththata, Malkki7eelenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Aaseeres Seraho geetettiza macca nay dawus. <verse eid="NUM 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Aaseere zarkketappe qoodettidayti 53,400 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Niftaaleme zarkkefe yelettidayti, Yahixelenne iza zereththata, Gunenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>Yexirenne iza zereththata, Shelemenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Niftaaleme zarkketappe qoodettidayti, 45,400 addeta.<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Kumeth qoodettida Isra7eele attumasay 601,730 gidides.<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>«Biittayo istta sunththa sunththa qooda mala zarkketas xinxxo gidana mala shaakka shaakkada imma. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/>Qoodan dariza zarkketas aassa imma; qoodan guuxxizaytas xunththa imma; biitta gishoy asaa qooda corateththaa mala gido. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Gidikkoka gishozi saaman gido; saamazikka yegettanay izaade zarkken zarkkenna. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Saamazi yegettanay qoodan daro zereththata giddoninne qoodan guuththa zereththata giddon gido.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:52-56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:13">Tay 34:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Lewe zarkkefe yelettidayti Gershoonenne iza zereththata, Qa7aatenne iza zereththata, Meraarenne iza zereththata, <verse eid="NUM 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Qasseka Libina zereththata, Kebroone zereththata, Mahile zereththata, Mushe zereththata, Qoore zereththata, Qa7aatey Amiraame ma7e. <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Amiraamey Gibxen yelettida Lewe nayo Yokaabedo machcho ekkides; izakka Aaroonenne Muse geetettiza nam7u attuma naytanne Maaramo geetettiza issi macca naa yeladus. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/>Aaroones Nadaabe, Abihu, El7ezeerenne Itamaare geetettiza oyddu attuma nayti deettes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:2">Tay 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/>Nadaabeynne Abihuy Xoossa sinththan bessontta tama shiishshida gishshas boshan hayqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lewe 10:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>Isttas layththay issi aginanne izappe bollara gidida Lewe zarkkefe addeta qooday 23,000 gidides; heytikka hankko Isra7eele asaappe dumma mazgaban xaafetti uttida; gaasoykka isttas Isra7eele deren xinxxos gidiza aykko gadey imettonttayssasa.<verse eid="NUM 26:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Museynne El7ezeerey Iyarkko ginara Yordaanoose shaafaa matan diza Mo7aabe demban Isra7eele asaa qoodida wode istti xaafi oykkida Isra7eele asaa qooday hayssafe bollan dizayta. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Museynne Aarooney koyro Siina bazzon deraa qoodida wode qoodettida attumasaappe shemppora paxa attiday baawa. <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>Hessi hessaththo haniday GODAY kase isttas, «Istti wurikka bazzo biittan hayqqana!» gida gishshassa; gido attiin Yoofine naa Kaalebeynne Nawe naa Iyaasoy attaafe ubbayka hayqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Tay 14:26-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Xilofaade Macca Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Yooseefey Minaase yelides; Minaasey Maakire yelides; Maakirey Gala7aade yelides; Gala7aadey Hefeere yelides; Hefeerey Xilofaade yelides; Xilofaades mahilo, No7o, Hogilo, Milkkonne Tirxxo geetettiza macca nayti deettes. <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>Isttika Gaytoteththa Dunkaaneza pengeeko biidi kumeththa maabaranne dereza kaaleththizayti dizason Musenne El7ezeere sinththan aadhdhi eqqidi, <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>«Nu aaway issi attuma naakka yelontta bazzo biittan hayqqides; izi GODAA bolla makkallida Qoore kaallizaytara issife zuppetibeenna; gido attiin izi ba nagara gaason hayqqides. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Histtiin izi attuma naa yelontta aggida gaason xalla nu aawa sunththi Isra7eele asaa giddofe qucetti dhayanaas bessizee? Hessa gishshas nuus bessiza xinxxo gade nu aawa dabbota giddon immite» gida.<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Musey istta oyshaa GODAA sinth shiishshides. <verse eid="NUM 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>GODAYKKA izas hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/>«Xilofaade macca nayti oychchida oyshay likke; hessa gishshas ne istta aawa dabbota giddon isttas xinxxo gade imma; kase istta aawa gadey gede isttas imetto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 36:2">Tay 36:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>Attuma naa yelontta hayqqidaadey diikko iza macca nay he izas dizaaz laattanaas dandayzayssa Isra7eele asaa erisa. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Izas macca naykka bayndaaz gidikko izas dizaaz iza ishati laattetto. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Ishaykka dontta aggiko iza aawa ishati laattetto. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Izas aawa ishay dontta aggiko izas matattiza dabboy iza aqota laattidi go7ettanaas dandayees; tani GODAY nena azazida mala Isra7eele dere asay hayssa ha wogaza baas eqqi diza woga histti naago.»<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyaaso Dooreteth</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Zaare 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>GODAY Muses, «Neni pude Abaarime zumata bolla kezada tani Isra7eele asaas immanaas qoppida biitta ubbaa yuushsha xeella. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>Neni iza beydaappe guye ne isha Aarooney hayqqoyssaththo nekka hayqqana; <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>Intte nam7atikka Xiine geetettiza bazzon ta azazo bolla makkallideta; kumeththa maabaray Mariiba haaththaa achchan dishe ta bolla makkallida wode intte Isra7eele asaa sinththan ta dummateththaa mala tana bonchchanaas ammanettibeekketa» gides; [Mariibay Xiine bazzon Qaadeesen diza pultto haaththa.]<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:12-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:23-27">Zaare 3:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:48-52">32:48-52</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Museykka GODAAKKO hizgi woossides, <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>«As ubbaas de7o immida GODAWU! Hayssa deraa heemmiza as neni doora; <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/>gaasoykka hayssa ne derezi heemmizay baynda wude mala gidontta mala izi deraa kessizaadenne gelththizaade, derezakka kaaleththizaade gidana.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Kawo 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Hizi 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mato 9:36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>GODAYKKA Muses, «Lo7o ayanay izan diza Nawe naa Iyaaso neekko ekkada ne kushe iza bolla woththa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:13">Kessa 24:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>Qeeseza El7ezeere sinththaninne kumeththa Isra7eele asaa sinththan ne iza essada izi ne olla doorettidayssa asaa erisa. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>Kumeththa Isra7eele maabaray izas azazettana mala nees diza maatappe izas shaakka imma. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>Qeese El7ezeerey Urimen GODAA shene shaakki eriza gishshas izi Iyaaso maaddana; hessa gishshas Iyaasoynne kumeththa Isra7eele maabaray El7ezeere azazon kezananne gelana» gides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Kessa 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 14:41">1Same 14:41</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">28:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Museykka GODAY iza azazida mala ooththides; Iyaasokka efidi qeese El7ezeere sinththaninne kumeththa Isra7eele asaa sinththan essides. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>GODAY iza azazida mala Musey ba kushe Iyaaso bolla woththidi iza basohozan doorides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:23">Zaare 31:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Gallas Gallas Shiiqiza Yarsho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Kessa 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>GODAY Muses, <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Iza sawoy tunnu gi tana ufayssana mala xuugettiza kaththa yarsho woden woden naagidi istti taas shiishshana mala ne istta azaza› ga yoota. <verse eid="NUM 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/>Qasseka isttas, ‹Taman xuugettidi taas shiiqana yarshoy hayssafe kaallizayssa; istta bolla wosoy baynda layth gidiza nam7u dharsho laaqqata gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshos shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Issi laaqqa maalado nam7anththoza omarsa wode shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>Issi issi laaqqara issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille issi litiro gidiza wogara zayten munuqettidi kaththa yarsho gidi shiiqo. <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Hessika gallas gallas shiiqiza xuugettiza yarsho; hessa mala yarsho sawoy tana GODAA ufayssiza yarsho gididi koyro Siina zumaa bolla shiiqana mala wogay wodhdhides. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Koyro laaqqazara shiiqiza ushsha yarshoy issi litiro gidiza mino ushshu geeshshasozan GODAAS gussite. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Omarsa wode nam7anththo laaqqaza koyroyssaththoka ushsha yarshoza gujjidi shiishshite; hessa sawoykka GODAA ufayssiza kaththa yarsho gidana.<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sambata Gallassa Yarsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>« ‹Sambata gallas, layth gidida wosoy istta bolla baynda nam7u dharsho laaqqata, ushsha yarshoranne nam7u kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi kaththa yarsho histti shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Hayssi ha yarshozi ushsha yarshozappenne gallas gallas xuugettiza yarshozappe Sambata gallas gallas shiiqiza hara xuugettiza yarsho.<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aginan Aginan Shiiqiza Yarsho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>« ‹Aginan aginan koyro gallas gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda nam7u mirgota, issi dharshonne layth kumida laappun dharsho laaqqata GODAAS xuugettiza yarsho histti shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Issi issi mirgora kaththa yarshos heedzdzu kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite; qasse dharshozara kaththa yarshos nam7u kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite; <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>issi issi dharsho laaqqara kaththa yarshos issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite; he xuugettiza yarshota ubbaa sawoy GODAA ufayssiza kaththa yarsho gidi shiiqo. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Issi issi mirgora nam7u litiro gidiza woyne ushshu, dharshozara issi litironne sayso gidiza woyne ushshunne issi issi laaqqara issi litiro gidiza woyne ushshu yarshos shiishshite; hessika aginan aginan layth kumeth shiiqiza xuugettiza yarsho. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Gallas gallas xuugettiza yarshonne izara shiiqiza ushsha yarshoza bolla deysha orge nagara gishshas yarsho gidana mala GODAA sinth shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paaziga Ba7aalenne Ukeththa Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Lewe 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>« ‹GODAAS Paaziga ba7aale koyro aginay gelida tammanne oydanththo gallas bonchchite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Kessa 12:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:1-2">Zaare 16:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/>Ha aginay gelida tammanne ichchashanththo gallassafe doommidi ukeththa ba7aale bonchchite; he gallassafe biidi laappun gallas gakkanaas uketh miite. <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Ba7aalezas koyro gallas goynnanaas shiiqite; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofte. <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Istta bolla wosoy baynda 2 mirgota, issi dharshonne layth kumida laappun dharsho laaqqata xuugettiza yarsho histti GODAAS shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Issi issi mirgora kaththa yarshos heedzdzu kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite; qasse dharshozara kaththa yarshos nam7u kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>Issi issi dharsho laaqqara kaththa yarshos issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Qasseka nagara wursanaas deysha orge nagara yarshos shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Heyti wurikka shiiqanay ubba wode maalado maalado xuugetti shiiqiza yarshora issife shiiqetto. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>GODAA sawo tunnu giidi ufayssiza kaththa yarsho laappun gallas kumeth issi malan shiishshite; hessaka gallas gallas shiiqiza xuugettiza yarsho bollanne ushsha yarsho bolla gujjidi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Laappunththo gallas goynnanaas shiiqite; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:14-20">Kessa 12:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:15">23:15</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:18">34:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 16:3-8">16:3-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaththa Shiisho Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Lewe 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>« ‹Kaththa shiishon ba7aale bonchchiza koyro gallas intte oorath gakkiza kaththaafe xeeraa GODAAS shiishshiza gallas goynnana shiiqiteppe attiin hara ay oosokka ooththofte. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Nam7u mirgota, issi dharshonne layth kumida laappun dharsho laaqqata sawo tunnu giidi GODAA ufayssiza xuugettiza yarsho shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Issi issi mirgora kaththa yarshos heedzdzu kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite; qasse dharshozara kaththa yarshos nam7u kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite; <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>issi issi dharsho laaqqara kaththa yarshos issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Qasseka nagara wursanaas deysha orge nagara yarshos shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Hessa he yarshoza ubbaa ushsha yarshora, he gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshozanne kaththa yarshoza bolla gujjidi shiishshite; he yarsho meheti wosoy bayndayta gididayssa shaakki erite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26-31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:16">Kessa 23:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:22">34:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-12">Zaare 16:9-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Ooraththa Layththi Gelishin Bonchchiza Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Lewe 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>« ‹Laappunththa aginay gelida koyro gallas goynnanaas shiiqite; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofte; he gallassay zayey punettiza gallassa. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Istta bolla wosoy baynda issi mirgo, issi dharshonne layth kumida laappun dharsho laaqqata sawoy tunnu giidi GODAA ufayssiza xuugettiza yarsho yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Issi mirgozara kaththa yarshos heedzdzu kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite; qasse dharshozara kaththa yarshos nam7u kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>Issi issi dharsho laaqqara kaththa yarshos issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Qasseka nagara wursanaas deysha orge nagara yarshos shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Intte hayssa ha yarshoza gallas gallassinne aginan aginan koyro gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshoza, kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza bolla gujjidi shiishshite; heytanttika sawo tunnu giidi GODAA ufayssiza xuugettiza yarshota.<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nagara Wurso Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Lewe 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>« ‹Laappunththo aginay gelida tammanththa gallas goynnanaas shiiqite; he gallas xoomite; oosokka ooththofte. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Istta bolla wosoy baynda issi mirgo, issi dharshonne layth kumida laappun dharsho laaqqata sawoy tunnu giidi GODAA ufayssiza xuugettiza yarsho yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Issi mirgozara kaththa yarshos heedzdzu kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite; qasse dharshozara kaththa yarshos 2 kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>Issi issi dharsho laaqqara kaththa yarshos issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:7-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:29-34">Lewe 16:29-34</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daase Ba7aale</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Lewe 23:33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>« ‹Laappunththa aginay gelida tammanne ichchashanththo gallas goynnanaas shiiqite; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofte; laappun gallas gakkanaas GODAAS daase ba7aale bonchchite. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Ha koyro gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda 13 mirgota; nam7u dharshotanne layth kumida tammanne oyddu dharsho laaqqata sawo tunnu giidi GODAA ufayssiza xuugettiza yarsho histti shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>Issi issi mirgora kaththa yarshos 3 kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqidi shiishshite; qasse issi issi dharshora kaththa yarshos 2 kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>Issi issi dharsho laaqqara kaththa yarshos issi kilo gidiza liiqo dhiille wogara zayten munuqi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>« ‹Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>« ‹Nam7anththo gallas istta bolla ay wosoy baynda 12 mirgota, 2 dharshotanne layththi kumida 14 dharsho laaqqata shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogaan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>« ‹Heedzdzanththo gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda tammanne issi mirgota, nam7u dharshotanne layththi kumida tammanne oyddu dharsho laaqqata shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogaan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>« ‹Oydanththo gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda tammu mirgota, nam7u dharshotanne layththi kumida tammanne oyddu dharsho laaqqata shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogaan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>« ‹Ichchashanththo gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda uddufun mirgota, nam7u dharshotanne layththi kumida tammanne oyddu dharsho laaqqata shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>« ‹Usuppunththo gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda osppun mirgota, nam7u dharshotanne layth kumida tammanne oyddu dharsho laaqqata shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogaan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>« ‹Laappunththa gallas istta bolla wosoy baynda laappun mirgota, nam7u dharshotanne layth kumida tammanne oyddu dharsho laaqqata shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogaan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>« ‹Osppunththa gallas issi bolla goynnanaas shiiqite; he gallas ay oosokka ooththofte. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Istta bolla wosoy baynda issi mirgo, issi dharshonne layth kumida laappun dharsho laaqqata sawo tunnu giidi GODAA ufayssiza xuugettiza yarsho histti shiishshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>Mirgotara, dharshotaranne dharsho laaqqatara issife shiiqiza kaththa yarshozanne ushsha yarshoza kase wogan wodhdhida qoodaa mala yarshite. <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Nagara wursanaas shiiqiza yarshos, kaththa yarshofe, ushsha yarshofenne gallas gallas shiiqi xuugettiza yarshofe hara deysha orge gujjidi shiishshite.<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>« ‹Inttes wodhdhida ba7aale gallassatan GODAAS shiishshite; hessika intte adinettidi shiishshiza yarshofenne intte intte dosan shiishshiza yarshofe xuugettiza hara yarsho, kaththa yarsho, ushsha yarshonne issifeteththa yarsho shiishshite› ga.»<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40"/>Museykka GODAY iza azazida mala Isra7eele asaas yootides.<verse eid="NUM 29:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Adina Gishshas Imettida Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa kaaleththiza korapinnetas, «GODAY azazida azazoy hayssafe kaallizayssa, <verse eid="NUM 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/>Issi asi GODAAS issi miish ooththanaas adinettiko woykko issaadey caaqqi geppidi bana barkka ba qaalan qachchiko izi ba gelida qaala ubbaa polana bessees attiin ba gidayssa agganaas bessenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:21-23">Zaare 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mato 5:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>«Issi geela7oya ba aawa soon dashe GODAAS issi miish ooththanaas adinettiko woykko caaqqa geppada bana barkka ba qaalan qachchizaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 30:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>izi aaway hessa siyidi izo diggontta aggiko iza ba adinettidayssa woykko ba caaqqa geppida qaalaza polanaas bessees. <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>Izi aaway he yo7oza siyidi izo diggizaa gidikko iza adinettida adinay woykko iza caaqqa geppida qaalay izis gome gidenna; gaasoykka izi aaway izo diggida gishshas GODAY izo maarana.<verse eid="NUM 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>«Azina gelontta maccassi akeekada woykko akeekontta adina adinetta uttada woykko caaqqa geppada bana barkka ba qaalan qachcha woththada azina gelikko, <verse eid="NUM 30:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>iza gelida azinazi he yo7oza siyidi izo diggontta aggiko iza ba gidayssa ubbaa polanaas bessees. <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>Izi azinay he yo7oza siyidi izo diggizaa gidikko iza adinettida adinay woykko iza caaqqa geppida qaalay izis gome gidenna; gaasoykka izi azinay izo diggida gishshas GODAY izo maarana.<verse eid="NUM 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>«Azinay hayqqida maccassi woykko azinay anjji yeddida maccassi issi miish ooththanaas adinettiko woykko caaqqa geppada bana barkka ba qaalan qachchidaa gidikko iza ba gelida qaalaa polanaas bessees.<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>«Azina gelida maccassi issi miish ooththanaas adinettiko woykko caaqqa geppada bana barkka ba qaalan qachchidaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 30:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>iza gelida azinazi he yo7oza siyidi izo diggontta aggiko iza ba gidayssa ubbaa polanaas bessees. <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>Izi azinay he yo7oza siyidi izo diggizaa gidikko iza adinettida adinay woykko iza caaqqa geppida qaalay izis gome gidenna; gaasoykka izi azinay izo diggida gishshas GODAY izo maarana. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Izi azinay ay adina woykko caaqqa geppada bana barkka qachchida qaalaa digganaas woykko polisanaas izas maatay dees. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Izi azinay he yo7oza siyida mala wonteththa gallas aykkoka qaattontta co7u giikko iza ba gidayssa ubbaa polanaas bessees; he yo7oza siyida mala aykkoka qaattontta co7u giikko hessi izi ero gidayssa qonccisees. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>Gido attiin izi azinay gam7idi he izi adinaza diggizaa gidikko alaafeteththan oyshettanay iza» gides.<verse eid="NUM 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Geela7oynne gelida maccassi adina adinettiko woykko caaqqa geppada barkka bana ba qaalan qachchidaa gidikko izi aawaas woykko izi azinaas diza alaafeteththanne maataa gishshas GODAY Muses immida wogay hayssa.<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s1">Midiyaame Dere Bolla Dendida Ola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>GODAY Muses, <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>«Midiyaame asay Isra7eele asaa bolla gaththida qohoza gishshas neni Midiyaame asaa halo kessa; hessa ooththidaappe guye neni hayqqana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Hessa gishshas Musey derezas, «Midiyaame asay GODAA bolla kase ooththida qohoza gishshas intte halo kessanaas olas giigettite. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Isra7eele asaa zarkkefe zarkkefe issi issi shii attumas dooridi gede olas yeddite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>Hessa gishshas Isra7eele zarkketappe issi issi shii as kessi immiin 12,000 asi olas gixettidi giigettides. <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Museykka issi issi zarkkefe issi issi shii asi qeese El7ezeere naa Finihaase kaaleththon olas yeddides; Finihaasikka geeshshasozappe dumma miishshatanne olas denththeththiza zayeta ba kushen oykkidi bides.<verse eid="NUM 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>Isttika GODAY Muse azazida mala Midiyaame asaa olidi attumasaa mulera wodhida. <verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>Hayqqidayta giddon Midiyaame kawo ichchashati Eeway, Ereqeemey, Xuurey, Uureynne Ereba7ey deettes; Bi7oore naa Balaamekka mashshan wodhida. <verse eid="NUM 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>Isra7eele asay Midiyaame maccassatanne guuththa nayta di7idi istta mehetanne istta aqota ubbaa pitti ekkides. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>Istti diza katamatanne istti diza gutata ubbaa taman xuuggida. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>Istta asaa, mehaanne di7ida miish ubbaa ekkida. <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththa ginara diza Mo7aabe demban dunkaani uttida Musekko, qeese El7ezeerekkonne kumeththa Isra7eele maabaraakko ehida.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Musey qeese El7ezeereynne maabaraa kaaleththizayti ola asaa mokkanaas gede kezida. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Musey gidikko olaasoppe haa simmiza ola asaa azaziza shaalaqata bollanne mato halaqata bolla hanqettides.<verse eid="NUM 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Izikka isttas, «Hayssa maccas ubbaa aazas wodhontta shemppora paxa aggidetii? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/>Nuni kase Pe7ooren dishin hayti Balaame zore ekkidi Isra7eele asay ba GODAAPPE haakkana malanne boshan wurana mala ooththiday istta gidettennee! <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>Hessa gishshas attuma nayta ubbaanne addera gayttida maccassata ubbaa wodhite. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Gido attiin addera gaytti erontta geela7ota wodhontta inttes ashshite.<verse eid="NUM 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>«Intte garsan as wodhidaadey woykko aha bochchida asi wurikka laappun gallas gakkanaas asi dizasoppe harason gam7o; heedzdzanththa gallassinne laappunththa gallas inttenanne intte di7i ehida maccassata geeshshite. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Hessaththoka ay may7o woykko galbafe, deysha iskefenne miththafe oosettida miish ubbaa geeshshite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Qeese El7ezeerey olappe simmida attumasaas, «GODAY Muses immida wogati hayssafe kaallizayta; <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>worqqay, biray, xarqimalay, biratay, qorqoroynne irsaasey, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>hessaththoka tamay istta qohonttayti tama giddora aadhdhidi geeyanaas bessees; tama dandayontta ay miishshika kase wodhdhida wogaa mala geeshos giigettida haaththan geeshshite. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Intte intte may7o laappunththa gallas meeccite; hessafe guye intte geesh gidiza gishshas simmidi kase intte dunkaani dizaso gelanaas dandayeeta» gides.<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Di7i Ehidayssa Gisheteth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>«Neni qeese El7ezeereynne deraa kaaleththiza korapinnetara gididi di7etti yida asaanne mehaa qoodite. <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Nam7u kessi shaakkidi baggaa olaso bida wottadaratas attoyssa hankko maabaraas immite. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>Wottadarata gishaappe di7ettida asaappe, miizatappe, haretappe dorsatappenne deyshatappe ichchashu xeetappe issino taas GODAAS dumma imota histti shaakkite. <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>He intte taas GODAAS shaakkidayssa ta gishaza qeese El7ezeeres immite. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Hinko maabaras imettida gishaappe, asaappe, miizaappe, dorsatappe, deyshatappenne haretappe ichchash tammaafe issino Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen alaafeteththan ooththiza Lewetas immite.» <verse eid="NUM 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Museynne El7ezeerey GODAY istta azazidayssa ubbaa ooththida.<verse eid="NUM 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Wottadarati banttas ekkishin attidayssi, 675,000 dorsatanne deyshata, <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>Laappun tammanne nam7u shii miizata, <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>Usuppun tammanne issi shii hareta, <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>Heedzdzu tammanne nam7u shii adde erontta geela7ota.<verse eid="NUM 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Di7etti yidayssafe baggay oletti yidaytas imettides; hessika 337,500 dorsata. <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>Isttafe 675 GODAAS dumma imota geetetti shaakettidayta. <verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>Miizati 36,000; isttafe GODAAS dumma imota gidi shaakettidayti laappun tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>Hareti 30,500; isttafe GODAAS dumma imota gidi shaakettidayti usuppuna. <verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>Adde erontta geela7oti 16,000; isttafe GODAAS dumma imota gididi shaakettidayti heedzdzu tammanne nam7a. <verse eid="NUM 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Hessa gishshas Musey GODAY iza azazida mala GODAAS dumma imota histti shaakkidayssa qeese El7ezeeres immides.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Hankko Isra7eele Maabaraa gishay olas kiitettida wottadarata gishara issi gina. <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>Hessika 337,500 dorsatanne deyshata, <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>Heedzdzu tammanne usuppun shii miizata, <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>Heedzdzu tammu shiyanne ichchashu xeetu hareta, <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>tammanne usuppun shii adde erontta geela7ota. <verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Hessa gishshas Musey ichchash tammaafe issino GODAY iza azazida mala Gaytoteththa Dunkaanen alaafeteththan ooththiza Lewe zarkketas immides.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Hessafe guye ola asaa azazizayti shaalaqatinne mato halaqati Museeko shiiqidi, <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>«Nuni ne oosanchchati nuuppe garsara azazettiza wottadarata ubbaa qoodidos; isttafe issoyka paccibeenna; <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>hessa gishshas nuni issoy issoy ekkida worqqa aleqota, toho gimota, kushe sagayota, biradhdhe midigata, hayththa gutichchata, qoodhen aadhdhiza maccifarata ubbaa nu nagaraa wursanaas GODAAS yarsho immanaas ekki yidos» gida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maccifara geetettizayssi beni wode maccassati seelos qoodhen aaththi may7iza birappe, worqqafe, xarqimalappenne dumma dumma miishshatappe oosettida alleqo miishsha.</char></note><verse eid="NUM 31:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Museynne qeese El7ezeerey worqqafe oosettida alleqota ubbaa ekkida. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Shalaqatappenne mato halaqatappe ekkidi Museynne qeese El7ezeerey GODAAS imota histti shiishshida worqqa alleqoti 16,750 saqile gidides.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">16,750 Saqile gizayssi kilon meezaanettishin 200 kilo giraame gidana.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Garsara diza wottadarati gidikko ba di7idayssa baas baas ekki bida. <verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Hessa gishshas Museynne qeese El7ezeerey shalaqatappenne mato halaqatappe ekkida worqqa alleqota GODAA sinththan Isra7eele deraa hassa7isana mala gede Gaytoteththa dunkaanezaakko ekki bida.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Yordaanoose Shaafaappe Arshey Mokkiza Baggara Diza Zarkketa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Zaare 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Oroobeele zarkketassinne Gaade zarkketas keehi daro mehey dees; Iyaazeere dereynne Gala7aade derey mehes daro lo7o gididayssa be7ida. <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>Hessa gishshas istti Musekko, qeese El7ezeerekkonne hankko maabara kaaleththizaytakko biidi, <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3-4"/>«GODAY Isra7eele asaan xoonisida Axaroote derey, Diboone derey, Iyaazeere derey, Nimra derey, Haseboone derey, El7eele derey, Sibima derey, Nebo dereynne Ba7oone derey mehes lo7o; nuuska daro mehey dees. <verse eid="NUM 32:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>Intte nuus lo7o qoppiko hayssa ha dereza nuus intte oosanchchatas daanaso histti immite attiin nuni Yordaanoose pinnana mala ooththofte» gida.<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Museykka isttas, «Intte ishati olas bishin intte haan attanaas koyeetii? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Isra7eele asay Yordaanoose pinnidi GODAY isttas immida dereza gelontta mala intte asaa hidota aazas qanxxiseetii? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Hanno biittayo xomosana mala Qaadeese Barineppe tani kase intte aawata yeddiin hayssaththoka ooththida. <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>Istti Eshkoole shoobbaa gakkanaas biidi he biittayo xomosi xeellida; gido attiin heeppe simmidi Isra7eele asay GODAY isttas immida dereza gelontta mala hidota qanxxisida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8-9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:17-33">Tay 13:17-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10-11"/>He gallas GODAY keehi hanqettidi, ‹Istti kumeththa wozinappe tana kaallontta ixxida gishshas Gibxeppe kezida asaappe layththay nam7u tammu kumidaytinne hessafe bollara gididayti ubbay tani Abrahaames, Yisaaqassinne Yaaqoobes immana gaada kase caaqqida biittaa istti mulekka gelontta mala caaqqadis› gides. <verse eid="NUM 32:10-11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>Hayssi GODAY caaqqi qachchida qaalazi GODAA kumeththa wozinappe kaallida Qenaaze dere as Yoofine naa Kaalebeppenne Nawe naa Iyaasoppe attiin hankko asaa ubbaaka bochchees. <verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/>GODAY Isra7eele dereza bolla hanqettida gishshas he iza hanqeththida yeletati ubbay wurana gakkanaas istti bazzo biittan oyddu tammu layth toylattana mala ooththides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:26-35">Tay 14:26-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>Intteno nagaranchcha yeletatoo! GODAY Isra7eele dere bolla gujji hanqettana mala ha7ikka intte intte aawataththo ooththeeta. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Intte Oroobeele zarkketinne Gaade zarkketi GODAA kaallontta ixxiko izi ha deraa ubbaa bazzon aggaagana; istta bolla gakkiza meto ubbaan intte oyshettana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Isttika Musekko shiiqidi, «Nuni nu mehetas aqoso, nu machchetassinne nu naytas duussaso ooththana koyoos. <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/>Gido attiin nu bagga Isra7eele asay baas duussaso gidida biittayo gelidi uttana gakkanaas nu ubbaafe sinththati olas kezanaas giigetti uttidos; nuni hessa polidi simmana gakkanaas nu naytinne nu machcheti hayssa ha derezan diza asaappe istta bolla qohoy gakkontta mala gimbettida katamaan hirgay baynda diishshetto. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Isra7eele asay ubbay baas baas giigettida biittaa ekkana gakkanaas nuni nuso simmoko. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Nuni nu gisha Yordaanooseppe arshey mokkiza baggara ekkida gishshas pinththafe istta gakkiza gishaappe nu aykkoka ekkoko» gida.<verse eid="NUM 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Museykka isttas, «Hayssi intte gidayssi tumu gidikko intte GODAA sinththan ola baanaas intte giigettidaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>qasseka GODAY ba morkketa ba sinththafe yedeththi kessana gakkanaas intte ubbatikka GODAA sinththan olas giigettidayta gididi Yordaanoose shaafaa pinniko, <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>biittayakka GODAAS haarettidaappe guye intte simmana dandayeeta; he wode intte GODAASSINNE Isra7eele asaas ooththanaas bessiza alaafeteth polidaappe guye hara aykkoka oyshetteketa; hessafe guye ha biittaya inttes xinxxo gidana.<verse eid="NUM 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>«Intte intte gida qaalaa naagontta aggiko intte GODAA qoheeta; intte nagara gishshas qixaatey intte bolla gakkanayssa erite. <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Hessa gishshas intte machchetassinne intte naytas duussaso, intte mehetaska aqoso ooththite; intte caaqo gelida qaalaakka polite» gides.<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Gaade zarkketinne Oroobeele zarkketi Muses, «Nuni ne oosanchchati neni nu goday nuna azazidayssa nu ooththana. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Nu machcheti, nu naytinne nu meheti hayssan Gala7aade katamatan gam7etto. <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Gido attiin nuni ne oosanchchati ola olettanaas gixettidayti wurikka GODAA sinththan olettanaas nu goday neni nuna azaziza mala gede he pinth nu pinnana» gida.<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Hessa gishshas Musey qeese El7ezeeres, Nawe naa Iyaasossinne Isra7eele maabaraa kaaleththiza korapinnetas istta gishshas, <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>«Gaade zarkketinne Oroobeele zarkketi Yordaanoose pinnidi GODAA sinththan olas giigettidi istti inttena maaddiin biittaya intte kushen geliza wode Gala7aade intte isttas xinxxo histti immite. <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Istti inttenara Yordaanoose shaafa pinni biidi olettontta aggiko isttika inttenara issife Kanaaneppe gishetti ekketto» gides.<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Gaade zarkketinne Oroobeele zarkketi, «Nuni ne oosanchchati GODAY nuna azazidayssa ubbaa ooththana. <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Nu olas GODAA sinth gede Kanaane pinnana; nu laattana biittay gidikko Yordaanoose shaafappe ha pinththan arshey mokkiza baggana» gi zaarida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:28-32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Iya 1:12-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Hessa gishshas Musey Amoore dere kawo Sihooney haariza deretanne Baasaane dere kawo Aagey haariza deren diza katamata, istta yuushon diza katamatanne dereta ubbaa Oroobeele qommotas, Gaade qommotassinne Minaase qommotappe baggaytas immides. <verse eid="NUM 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Gaade qommoti, Diboone, Axaroote, Aaro7eere, <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>Axaroote-Sofaane, Iyaazeere, Yogibaha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>Beeti-Niimirenenne Beeti-Haaraane yuuyi aadhdhanaas gimbe gimbida; ba mehetaska aqoso keexxida.<verse eid="NUM 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Oroobeele zarkketi Haseboone, El7eele, Qiriyaatayme katamata zaari gimbida. <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>Hessaththoka guyeppe isttas sunththay laamettida Nebo, Ba7aali-Me7oonenne Seebama katamata zaari gimbida; he katamata ubbatas ooraththa sunth sunththida.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Minaase naa Maakire zereththati Gala7aade oli oykkidi kase heen diza Amoore asata yedeththi kessida. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Hessa gishshas Musey Gala7aade dere Minaase naa Maakire zereththatas immides; isttika banttas heen duussaso ooththida. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Minaase zarkkefe gidida Ya7irey issi issi gutatan meto gaththidi baas ekkides; isttika, «Habot-Ya7ire»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:41</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Habot-Ya7ire: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Habot-Ya7ire guussi Ya7ire gutata guussa.</char></note> gi sunththides. <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Nobahey qasse Qenaatenne iza yuushon diza gutata oli oykkidi ba sunththan, «Nobahe» gi sunththides.<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asay Gibxeppe Mo7aabe Gakkanaas Bida Taarike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Isra7eele asay ba zarkken zarkken shaaketti shaaketti Museynne Aarooney kaaleththiin Gibxeppe kezidaappe guye dumma dumma wode istti dunkaani uttidasohoti hayssafe kaallizayta; <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>istti dumma dumma wode dunkaani uttidasohota sunththaa GODAY azazida mala Musey xaafides.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>Isra7eele asay koyro aginay gelida 15 gallas Paaziga ba7aaleppe wonteth Gibxe asay ubbay istti xeellishin yayyontta Eraamise katama yeggi kezides. <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>He wode Gibxe asay istta giddofe GODAA boshan hayqqida bayrata bayrata moogon deettes; he wode GODAY istta eeqa xoossata bollaka pirdides. <verse eid="NUM 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Isra7eele asay Eraamiseppe dendi biidi Sukooten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>Sukooteppe dendidi bazzo gaxa bolla diza Etaamen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>Etaameppe dendidi Ba7aali-Xafooneppe arshey mokkiza baggara diza Pihaahiroote simmidi Migidoole heeran dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>Pihaahirooteppe dendidi Zo7o abba pinnidi Etaame bazzo bides; Etaame bazzon heedzdzu gallas gakkanaas biidi Maara gakki dunkaanides; <verse eid="NUM 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>Maarappe dendidi tammanne nam7u haaththa pulttotinne laappun tammu tamire miththati dizaso Eelaame gakki dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>Eelaameppe dendidi Zo7o abbaa matan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>Zo7o abbaa matappe dendidi Siina bazzon dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>Siina bazzofe dendidi Dufiqan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>Dufiqappe dendidi Alushen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>Alusheppe dendidi ushsha haaththi bayndason Erafidimen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>Erafidimeppe dendidi Siina bazzon dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>Siina bazzofe dendidi Kibroote-Hatta7aaben dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>Kibroote-Hatta7aabeppe dendidi Haxirooten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>Haxirooteppe dendidi Eretiman dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>Eretimappe dendidi Eremon-Perezen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>Eremon-Perezeppe dendidi Libinan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>Libinappe dendidi Erisan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>Ersappe dendidi Qahalaaten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>Qahalaateppe dendidi Shefere zuman dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>Shefere Zumaappe dendidi Haradan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>Haradappe dendidi Maqihaloten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>Mahalooteppe dendidi Tahaaten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>Tahaateppe dendidi Taaran dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>Taarappe dendidi Mitiqan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>Mitiqappe dendidi Hashemoonen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>Hashemooneppe dendidi Moserooten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>Moserooteppe dendidi Beeni Yaqinen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>Beeni Yaqineppe dendidi Hori-Haggidigan dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>Hori-Haggidigappe dendidi Yoxbaaten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>Yoxbaateppe dendidi Abroonen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>Abrooneppe dendidi Eexiyoon-Gaabiren dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>Eexiyoon-Gaabireppe dendidi Xiine bazzon diza Qaadeesen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>Qaadeeseppe dendidi Eedoome dere dhassan diza Hoore zuman dunkaani uttides.<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>Qeese Aarooney GODAA azazon pude Hoore zumaa bolla kezides; heen Isra7eele asay Gibxeppe kezida oyddu tammanththa layththan ichchashanththo aginay xeerida koyro gallas hayqqides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:22-28">Tay 20:22-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:6">Zaare 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:50">32:50</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Aarooney Hoore zumaa bolla hayqqiza wode iza layththay xeetanne nam7u tammanne heedzdza.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Kanaane biittan Negeben diza Kanaane as Araade kawoy Isra7eele asay yizayssa siyides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:1">Tay 21:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 33:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>Derezikka Hoore zumaappe dendidi Xelimonan dunkaani uttida. <verse eid="NUM 33:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>Xelimonappe dendidi Panoonen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>Panooneppe dendidi Obooten dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>Obooteppe dendidi Mo7aabe dhassan diza Iye-Abaarimen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>Iye-Abaarimeppe dendidi Diboon-Gaaden dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>Diboon-Gaadeppe dendidi Almmoon-Dibilatayen dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>Almmoon-Dibilatayeppe dendi Nebo matan diza Abaarime zumata bolla dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>Abaarime zumatappe dendidi Iyarkkofe Yordaanoose pinththan diza Mo7aabe demban dunkaani uttides. <verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>Heen Yordaanoose matan Mo7aabe demban Beeti-Yashimooteppe biidi Aabeeli-Shuutime gakkanaas dunkaani uttides.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yordaanoose Pinnidi Ooththanaas Bessiza Woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Iyarkko ginara Yordaanoose pinththan Mo7aabe demban istti dishin Isra7eele derezas yootana mala GODAY Muses hayssafe kaalliza wogaa immides. <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>Neni Isra7eele asaas, «Intte Kanaane dere gelanaas Yordaanoose pinniza wode, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>he biittaan diza asaa ubbaa intte sinththafe gooddi kessite; shuchchafenne biratappe oosettida istta eeqa xoossata menththereththi yeggite; hessaththoka dhoqqasohotan diza istti goynnizasotakka laallite. <verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Tani he biittayo inttes immida gishshas laattidi intte izin diite. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/>Biittayo intte zarkken zarkken gishetti ekkite; qoodan dariza zarkkes dalga gade immite; qoodan guuxxiza zarkketas xunththa gade immite; issoy issoy ba zarkken zarkken biittayo ay gidiinkka saamay gaththida mala baas laata gade histti ekko.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:54 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:54-56">Tay 26:54-56</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 33:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>«Kase he biittan diza asata ubbaa gooddi kessontta isttafe shaakki ashshiko istti intte ayfe caddi toyssiza pilqe mala gidana; mille caddiza agunththa mala gididi istti inttena waayisana; intte diza derezan istti ubba wode ola denththi denththi inttena metoththana. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Intte hessaththo ooththontta aggiko tani istta dhayssana ga qoppoyssa intte bolla zaara polana» gides.<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Kanaane Dere Yuushon Diza Dereta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>«Isra7eele asaa, ‹Tani inttes immiza Kanaane biittayo intte biidi geliza wode izi yuushon diza dereti hayssafe kaallizayta; <verse eid="NUM 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>dugeha baggara Xiine bazzofe dendidi Eedoome bazzo achchara kanththi biidi arshey mokkiza baggara Hayqo abbaafe dugeha bagga xeera bollara doommidi, <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>Aqraabime purdera kanththi aadhdhidi Xiine gakkidi dugeha baggara Qaadeese Barine gakkees; hessafe Haxaare-Adaare kanththidi Aximoone gakkees. <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Aximooneppe doommidi haaththi baynda Gibxe shaafatara yuuyi aadhdhidi Mediteraane abbaan eqqees.<verse eid="NUM 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>« ‹Arshey wulliza baggara Mediteraane abbay zawa gidana.<verse eid="NUM 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>« ‹Pudeha baggara diza zaway Mediteraane abbafe biidi Uure zuma gakkees. <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>Uure zumaappe biidi Hamaatera aadhdhi biidi Xedaade gakkees. <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>Gede Zipiroone pinnidi Haxaare-Enaane gakki eqqees; hayssi ubbay inttes pudeha baggara diza zawa gidana.<verse eid="NUM 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>« ‹Arshey mokkiza baggara Haxaare-Eenaneppe biidi Shafaame gakkanaas malata woththite. <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>Zawazi Shafaameppe doommidi Ayineppe arshey mokkiza baggara Erebila kanththi aadhdhidi Galila abbaafe arshey mokkiza baggara diza zoozetara kanththidi, <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>Yordaanoose shaafa wodhdhees; heera biidi wurseththazi Hayqo Abba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hayqo Abba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hayqo Abba gizayssa issi issi Geeshsha Maxaafa birsheththati Maxine abba geettes.</char></note> gidana; hayti intte biittayo yuuyi aadhdhiza zawata gidana› gaada azaza.»<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Musey Isra7eele asaa, «Saama yeggidi intte laattana mala uddufun zarkketassinne Minaase zarkkefe baggaytas he biittay imettana mala GODAY azazides. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Oroobeele zarkketi Gaade zarkketinne Minaases bagga zarkketi baas imettida biittaa laattida. <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>Isttika Yordaanooseppe he pinththan Iyarkko ginara arshey mokkiza baggara bana gakkiza xinxxoza ekkida» gi yootides.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:13-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:1-5">Iya 14:1-5</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biitta Gishanaas Doorettida Asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>«Qeese El7ezeereynne Nawe naa Iyaasoy gadeza derezas gishetto. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>Istti biittaa gishiza wode istta maaddanaas zarkkefe zarkkefe korapinne ekka. <verse eid="NUM 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>He ne ekkana asata sunththi hayssafe kaallizayssa; Yuhuda zarkkefe Yoofine naa Kaalebe, <verse eid="NUM 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>Simoona zarkkefe Amihuude naa Sameela, <verse eid="NUM 34:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>Biniyaame zarkkefe Kisaloone naa Eldaade, <verse eid="NUM 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Daane zarkkefe Yogile naa Buuqa, <verse eid="NUM 34:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>Yooseefe zarkkefe Minaase bagga Sufide naa Han7eele, <verse eid="NUM 34:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>Yooseefe zarkkefe Efreeme bagga Shifixe naa Qamu7eele, <verse eid="NUM 34:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>Zaabiloone zarkkefe Perinaake naa Elxafaane, <verse eid="NUM 34:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>Yisakoore zarkkefe Hooza naa Palti7eele, <verse eid="NUM 34:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>Aaseere zarkkefe Seleeme naa Ahude, <verse eid="NUM 34:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>Niftaaleme zarkkefe Amihuude naa Pedaheele.» <verse eid="NUM 34:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Haytanti Isra7eele asaas Kanaanen biittaa gishi immana mala GODAY doorida asata.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Lewe Zarkketas Imettida Katamata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Iyarkko ginara Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan diza Mo7aabe dembaa bolla GODAY Muses hizgides, <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>«Isra7eele asay ba gishaappe gishaappe Lewe zarkketi daana katamatanne he katamata yuushon istti ba mehe izan heemmana gade immana mala yoota. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>He katamatikka Lewe zarkketas duussaso gidana gides; mehe heemmizasohoti istta mehey pe7izaso gidana. <verse eid="NUM 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Katamata yuushon intte Lewe zarkketas immana mehe heenththa gadeza aakoteththay katamaa gimbezappe doommidi oyddu baggarakka 1,000 wadha wadha gido. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Hessa malan katamaza giddo aaththidi oyddu baggarakka gulappe biidi gula gakkanaas 2,000 wadha gido; hessa Lewe qommoti baas mehe heenththasoho histtetto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gula geetettizayssi issi issi bagga Gamoththo qaalan zooze woykko denqeshe geetettees.</char></note><verse eid="NUM 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shemppo Wodhidayti Baqati Attiza Katamata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Zaare 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Iya 20:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>«Lewe qommotas intte immiza katamatappe usuppunati as wodhida asi baqati attiza katamata gidetto; heytappe hara 42 katamata gujji immite. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>Istti mehe heemmizasohotara gujjiin 48 katamati imettetto. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Isra7eele zarkketi laattida gadeppe istta gade gade dalgateththaa mala dalga gade oykkidaytappe dalga, xunththa gade oykkidaytappe xunth ekkidi Lewe zarkketas immite.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:1-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:1-42">Iya 21:1-42</ref></char></note><verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>GODAY Muses hizgi yootides, <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>«Neni Isra7eele asaas, ‹Intte Kanaane dere gelanaas Yordaanoose shaafaa pinniza wode, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>issi asi erontta dishe as wodhikko hessaadey baqati biidi attana katamata ne doora. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>He katamati shemppo wodhidaadey pirdas shiiqontta dishin hayqqidaade dabboy iza wodhontta mala izi baqati attiza katamata gidetto. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Hayti intte Lewetas immida usuppun katamati erontta shemppo wodhida asi baqati attiza katamata gidana. <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>He katamatappe heedzdzati Yordaanoose shaafaappe he pinththan arshey mokkiza baggara hankko heedzdzati qasse Kanaane biittan gidetto. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Ha usuppun katamati erontta dishe as wodhida Isra7eele asi, imaththatinne intte giddon diza hara dere asati baqati attizaso gidetto.<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Suuththa Azareth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>« ‹Issi asi biratappe oosettidaazan as wodhidaa gidikko he shemppo wodhidaadey izikka asa kushen hayqqo. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Issi asi shuchchan caddidi as wodhidaa gidikko he shemppo wodhidaadey izikka asa kushen hayqqo. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Issi asi miththan caddi as wodhidaa gidikko he shemppo wodhidaadeyka asa kushen hayqqo. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>He hayqqidayssas mata dabboy suuth azaranaas dandayza gishshas awanka demmiko wodhanaas dandayees.<verse eid="NUM 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>« ‹Issi asi odidi as sugi yeggi wodhikko woykko geemason uttidi issi miishshan caddi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Odidi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Odidi gizayssa issi issi bagga Gamoththon eridi woykko erishe geetettees.</char></note> <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>wodhikko morkketeththan dendidi icci wodhikko izi shemppo wodhida gishshas izikka asa kushen hayqqanaas bessees; he hayqqidayssas mata dabboy suuth accanaas dandayza gishshas awanka demmiko wodhanaas dandayees.<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>« ‹Gido attiin issi asi erontta dishe as sugi wodhikko woykko qoppontta dishe issi miishshan caddi wodhikko, <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>woykko erontta dishe shuch iza bolla yeggi wodhizaa gidikko hessaadey iza qohanaas odi ooththontta gishshas, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>derezi he wodhidayssa giddoninne hayqqidayssa dabbota giddon imettana pirday hayssafe kaallizayssa gido. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Erontta dishe as wodhidaadey suuth acciza asa kusheppe derezi ashshidi izi baqati attida katama zaaro; zayten tiyettida qeeseta halaqay hayqqana gakkanaas izi heen gam7o.<verse eid="NUM 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>« ‹As wodhidi kasasetidayssi baqati attiza katamaappe kare kezizaa gidikko, <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>suuththa accizaadey demmidi iza wodhikko suuththa acon oyshettenna. <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>As wodhidi kasasetidayssi qeeseta halaqay hayqqana gakkanaas baqati attiza katamaan gam7o; qeeseta halaqazi hayqqidaappe guye izi baso simmana dandayees.<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>« ‹Hayssi ha wogazi intte diza dere ubbaan inttessinne intte zereththatas eqqi diza woga gido.<verse eid="NUM 35:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>« ‹Shempo wodhida ay asikka hayqo pirda pirdettanaas dandayzay iza bolla nam7u markkay woykko izappe bollara markkattiko attiin issi markkan xalla hayqo qixaate ekkenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Zaare 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:7">Tay 27:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="NUM 35:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>Shemppo wodhiin hayqo pirday iza bolla pirdettida asi hayqqana bessees attiin ba wodhida shemppo gishshas miishshe qanxxi attanaas dandayenna. <verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>Izan baqati attiza katama baqatida oonappeka qeeseta halaqay hayqqanaappe kase izi guye simmidi ba biittan de7ana mala giidi suuththa qanxxo ekkofte. <verse eid="NUM 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>Intte hessaththo ooththizaa gidikko intte biittaa tuniseeta; gaasoykka asa suuth gussizayssi biitta tunisees; he biittay geeyanay asa suuth gussidaade suuththay gukkiin attiin haran geeyenna. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Tani intte GODAA gidida gishshassinne inttenara Isra7eele dereza giddon diza gishshas tani izan diza biittaa tunisopite› ga yoota.»<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Xilofaade Macca Naytas Imettida Xinxxo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Yooseefe naa Minaasey yelida Maakire naa Gala7aade zarkketa kaaleththiza halaqati Musekkonne Isra7eele asaa kaaleththizaytakko shiiqidi, <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>«Neni hanno biittayo Isra7eele derezas saaman gishana mala GODAY nena nu godaza azazides; hessaththoka nu isha Xilofaade gisha iza macca naytas immana mala nena azazides. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Gido attiin istti geliza azinati hara qommofe gidikko istta gisha gadey nu zarkketa xinxxofe qanxxettidi he istti gelida azinata zarkketas gujettiza gishshas nu zarkketa xinxxozi kase ekettoyssafe pace gidees. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Wozzo layththay gakkiza wode istta gishazi istti gelida zarkkes gujettees; hessa gishshas istta xinxxoy nu zarkketa xinxxo pacinchchees» gida.<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Hessafe guye Musey GODAY izas yootida mala Isra7eele asaas, «Minaase zarkketi gidayssi wurikka likke. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/>Hessa gishshas GODAY Xilofaade macca nayti ba zarkketa giddofe ba dosidaade gelanaas dandayeettes. <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>Hessa malan Isra7eele asaa xinxxoy issi zarkkefe hara zarkken aadhdhofo; Isra7eele asay kase ba aawatappe laattida biitta minththi oykko. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Isra7eele asaa zarkketa giddon ba aawa gade laattida maccassi oonikka ba qommo gelanaas bessees; hessa malan Isra7eele asay ubbay ba aawata xinxxo naaganaas dandayees. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Hessa gishshas gadezi issi zarkke kusheppe hara zarkke kushen aadhdhanaas dandayenna; wurikka ba zarkken zarkken ba biitta oykki naago» gides.<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Xilofaade macca nayti GODAY Muse azazida mala ooththida. <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/>Xilofaade macca nayti Mahilo, Tirxxo, Hogilo, Milkko, No7o; heytantti ba aawa ishata nayta gelida. <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>Yooseefe naa Minaase zarkketa giddon azina gelida; he istta biittay istta aawata zarkke sunththan minni attides.<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Isra7eele asay Iyarkko ginara Yordaanoose shaafappe he pinththan Mo7aabe demban dishin GODAY Muse baggara isttas immida wogatinne azazoti haytantta.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
